(6764476, 1014617, 15711, '<td valign="top">That Willie Nelson song''s lyrics "the night life ain''t no life, but it''s my life" came into my head.  Gorgeous reflective quality.  That blue is just delicious.</td>', 'That Willie Nelson song''s lyrics "the night life ain''t no life, but it''s my life" came into my head.  Gorgeous reflective quality.  That blue is just delicious.', '2012-05-09 10:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764478, 1014619, 15711, '<td valign="top">This almost makes me think of a charcoal or pastel drawing.  I like the sense of long ago.  Nice going.</td>', 'This almost makes me think of a charcoal or pastel drawing.  I like the sense of long ago.  Nice going.', '2012-05-09 10:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764479, 1014578, 15711, '<td valign="top">Those swans made me smile.  I like the textures of it all.</td>', 'Those swans made me smile.  I like the textures of it all.', '2012-05-09 10:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764480, 1014577, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the rich textural variations.  Those clouds are just delicious.</td>', 'I really enjoy the rich textural variations.  Those clouds are just delicious.', '2012-05-09 10:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764481, 1014210, 92577, '<td valign="top">great viewpoint</td>', 'great viewpoint', '2012-05-09 10:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764482, 1014630, 15711, '<td valign="top">The perfect reflective sunset.  I like that the tree line isn''t straight all the way across.  I could look at this all day.  It''d make a beautiful print on canvas.</td>', 'The perfect reflective sunset.  I like that the tree line isn''t straight all the way across.  I could look at this all day.  It''d make a beautiful print on canvas.', '2012-05-09 10:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
