(6764696, 1014377, 54446, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  <strike>8</strike>  Bumping this up a point, as I review all the images in this challenge.  This one stands out head and shoulders above the others.  10</td>', 'Gorgeous!  8  Bumping this up a point, as I review all the images in this challenge.  This one stands out head and shoulders above the others.  10', '2012-05-09 13:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764697, 1014176, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very difficult acute angle to the sun.  Actually, you''re looking at the sun!!!!!   An amazing sky, pleasant composition and interesting trees.  8</td>', 'Very difficult acute angle to the sun.  Actually, you''re looking at the sun!!!!!   An amazing sky, pleasant composition and interesting trees.  8', '2012-05-09 13:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764707, 1013809, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great job on capturing the rainbows.   You have a good understanding of light refraction and height of sun relationship to capture this image.  Bumping this up on a daylight review of all entries.  I agree with your selection of a "portrait" orientation for this particular subject.  It''s a narrow gorge.  Colorado is really dry.  Wish we had that kind of water flow!  10</td>', 'Great job on capturing the rainbows.   You have a good understanding of light refraction and height of sun relationship to capture this image.  Bumping this up on a daylight review of all entries.  I agree with your selection of a "portrait" orientation for this particular subject.  It''s a narrow gorge.  Colorado is really dry.  Wish we had that kind of water flow!  10', '2012-05-09 13:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764708, 1014612, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Love the green to blue gradient in the ocean.  Superb control of exposure.  It''s really a great presentation.  Should do well in this challenge.  9</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Love the green to blue gradient in the ocean.  Superb control of exposure.  It''s really a great presentation.  Should do well in this challenge.  9', '2012-05-09 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764712, 1014435, 54446, '<td valign="top">Hurrah!  My back yard.  I know this exact spot.  That looks like today''s sky.  This is Upper Beaver Meadows.  The cottonwoods in the valley are beautiful.  Long''s Peak was enshrouded today, following the dusting of snow on Sunday and Monday.  Well done!  10</td>', 'Hurrah!  My back yard.  I know this exact spot.  That looks like today''s sky.  This is Upper Beaver Meadows.  The cottonwoods in the valley are beautiful.  Long''s Peak was enshrouded today, following the dusting of snow on Sunday and Monday.  Well done!  10', '2012-05-09 13:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764716, 1014376, 54446, '<td valign="top">I''m bumping this up on a daylight review of all images.  Great scene!  Must be a single image because the bird detail in sky and surf is so very good.  9</td>', 'I''m bumping this up on a daylight review of all images.  Great scene!  Must be a single image because the bird detail in sky and surf is so very good.  9', '2012-05-09 13:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
