(6764753, 1013805, 54446, '<td valign="top">Love the yellow, green and blue colors.</td>', 'Love the yellow, green and blue colors.', '2012-05-09 14:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764771, 1014596, 10785, '<td valign="top">Goodcolor, good light and the photo is nice and sharp and crisp. You did good to get foreground, midground and background layers to the shot. A few things to improve upon... well the wires are a distraction. Probably unavoidable but they are. Perhaps turning to the right to get more of te vineyard into te shot would help. Also the sky is bright and uninteresting so maybe another time of day or shortly after a weather event would have helped that out more. All in all a good, colorful documentary shot.</td>', 'Goodcolor, good light and the photo is nice and sharp and crisp. You did good to get foreground, midground and background layers to the shot. A few things to improve upon... well the wires are a distraction. Probably unavoidable but they are. Perhaps turning to the right to get more of te vineyard into te shot would help. Also the sky is bright and uninteresting so maybe another time of day or shortly after a weather event would have helped that out more. All in all a good, colorful documentary shot.', '2012-05-09 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764772, 1014498, 10785, '<td valign="top">Rotation of the horizon is a key part of processing the landscape.</td>', 'Rotation of the horizon is a key part of processing the landscape.', '2012-05-09 14:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764773, 1014101, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like how the waters edge takes you right to the people creating a focal point, yetI can still enjoy the entire scene you have depicted.</td>', 'I like how the waters edge takes you right to the people creating a focal point, yetI can still enjoy the entire scene you have depicted.', '2012-05-09 14:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764774, 1013783, 135629, '<td valign="top">A bit over processed for me, but nice colors in the sky. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A bit over processed for me, but nice colors in the sky. Good luck in the challenge.', '2012-05-09 14:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764776, 1014486, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think using a more strict rule of thirds composition and putting the church building not only into the bottom third, but also into the left most third of the frame would have created a much, much stronger composition, especially combined with the leading lines of the crops.</td>', 'I think using a more strict rule of thirds composition and putting the church building not only into the bottom third, but also into the left most third of the frame would have created a much, much stronger composition, especially combined with the leading lines of the crops.', '2012-05-09 14:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764778, 1014494, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wondeful light!</td>', 'Wondeful light!', '2012-05-09 14:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764781, 1014065, 135629, '<td valign="top">I like it! The dof through the grass, and the horizon and the sky is very nice.</td>', 'I like it! The dof through the grass, and the horizon and the sky is very nice.', '2012-05-09 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764783, 1014464, 135629, '<td valign="top">A nice photo indeed, but maybe for another challenge?</td>', 'A nice photo indeed, but maybe for another challenge?', '2012-05-09 14:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764786, 1014612, 135629, '<td valign="top">NICE! Favorite sor far. Good luck!</td>', 'NICE! Favorite sor far. Good luck!', '2012-05-09 14:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764787, 1013381, 135629, '<td valign="top">Eerie and beautiful.</td>', 'Eerie and beautiful.', '2012-05-09 14:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764788, 1014094, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely leading line and I really like the dawn/dusk lighting. I like that it has a soft focus effect which compliments the lighting however, there does appear to be a lot of camera shake due to being handheld at slower shutter speed. Just as a reminder to myself because I fall prey to this all the time, the best ratio of shutter speed to focal length for handholding is 1/zoom length. Therefore at 50mm the shutter should be no less than 1/50. And as a recommendation handholding any less than 1/50 - 1/60 is probably going to cause slight camera shake. A tripod could have helped here.</td>', 'Lovely leading line and I really like the dawn/dusk lighting. I like that it has a soft focus effect which compliments the lighting however, there does appear to be a lot of camera shake due to being handheld at slower shutter speed. Just as a reminder to myself because I fall prey to this all the time, the best ratio of shutter speed to focal length for handholding is 1/zoom length. Therefore at 50mm the shutter should be no less than 1/50. And as a recommendation handholding any less than 1/50 - 1/60 is probably going to cause slight camera shake. A tripod could have helped here.', '2012-05-09 14:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764792, 1014440, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the landscape. It''s nice and bright and shows off the spring season. Water is always a good element to have and you have nice framing with the trees. I would say to move in and shoot with a wider focal length to get rid of the uninteresting foreground. Or zoom in from that position to include more of the middle of the scene framed by the trees further out to the edges. Another option could have been to shoot lower from that position to get a better perspective with the foreground included.</td>', 'I like the landscape. It''s nice and bright and shows off the spring season. Water is always a good element to have and you have nice framing with the trees. I would say to move in and shoot with a wider focal length to get rid of the uninteresting foreground. Or zoom in from that position to include more of the middle of the scene framed by the trees further out to the edges. Another option could have been to shoot lower from that position to get a better perspective with the foreground included.', '2012-05-09 14:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764796, 1014615, 10785, '<td valign="top">Now here''s a shot where the wires work to form the composition. Combinned with the pole, all the lines lead to a focal point just under that moving cloud. Lovely use of slower shutter speed to record some movement!</td>', 'Now here''s a shot where the wires work to form the composition. Combinned with the pole, all the lines lead to a focal point just under that moving cloud. Lovely use of slower shutter speed to record some movement!', '2012-05-09 15:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764822, 1014489, 126709, '<td valign="top">I love the layers of light and depth in this.  Just a great landscape in my opinion.</td>', 'I love the layers of light and depth in this.  Just a great landscape in my opinion.', '2012-05-09 15:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764824, 1014630, 126709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and I love the color saturation.  HDR maybe? If so it works well.</td>', 'Beautiful light and I love the color saturation.  HDR maybe? If so it works well.', '2012-05-09 15:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764827, 1014645, 126709, '<td valign="top">Almost 3D. Great simple landscape. I think a blue sky would take away from this.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Almost 3D. Great simple landscape. I think a blue sky would take away from this.  Nice photo.', '2012-05-09 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764831, 1013783, 126709, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing some will not like this but I do.  Well done on the PP.  It''s different.</td>', 'I''m guessing some will not like this but I do.  Well done on the PP.  It''s different.', '2012-05-09 15:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764834, 1014376, 126709, '<td valign="top">I love the color contrast from left to right.  Also found it fun to find all the gulls. Nice photo!</td>', 'I love the color contrast from left to right.  Also found it fun to find all the gulls. Nice photo!', '2012-05-09 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764836, 1014001, 126709, '<td valign="top">Well done simple landscape. The DOF makes the photo.</td>', 'Well done simple landscape. The DOF makes the photo.', '2012-05-09 15:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764838, 1014382, 126709, '<td valign="top">It''s almost a stretch to see all that this photo has to offer.  I really like that you decided to use portrait and include the dead-space in the middle.  Very nice!</td>', 'It''s almost a stretch to see all that this photo has to offer.  I really like that you decided to use portrait and include the dead-space in the middle.  Very nice!', '2012-05-09 15:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764841, 1014359, 126709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette of the trees in foreground and love the yellow glow on blue.</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette of the trees in foreground and love the yellow glow on blue.', '2012-05-09 15:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764842, 1014299, 126709, '<td valign="top">Love the clouds, great depth to the photo.</td>', 'Love the clouds, great depth to the photo.', '2012-05-09 15:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764843, 1014371, 126709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful evening light and I like the touch of gold in the foreground.  Nice photo!</td>', 'Beautiful evening light and I like the touch of gold in the foreground.  Nice photo!', '2012-05-09 15:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764844, 1013805, 126709, '<td valign="top">Light and shadow. Great for landscape photos.  Nice!</td>', 'Light and shadow. Great for landscape photos.  Nice!', '2012-05-09 15:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764847, 1014491, 126709, '<td valign="top">Simple and serene. Almost wish you had cropped the foreground out though.  I used a piece of paper to crop it on my screen and think it enhances the feeling.  Still a great photo.</td>', 'Simple and serene. Almost wish you had cropped the foreground out though.  I used a piece of paper to crop it on my screen and think it enhances the feeling.  Still a great photo.', '2012-05-09 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764848, 1014486, 126709, '<td valign="top">I really like the bleached look to this.  Nice composition too.</td>', 'I really like the bleached look to this.  Nice composition too.', '2012-05-09 15:58:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6764850, 1014094, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I can almost feel the road as I ride along it.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I can almost feel the road as I ride along it.', '2012-05-09 16:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764851, 1014589, 126709, '<td valign="top">Great light and I really like the mast lights on the boats. Adds a bit to the sky.</td>', 'Great light and I really like the mast lights on the boats. Adds a bit to the sky.', '2012-05-09 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764852, 1013599, 126709, '<td valign="top">Not the typical landscape but I like it.</td>', 'Not the typical landscape but I like it.', '2012-05-09 16:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764854, 1014599, 126709, '<td valign="top">HDR works well in this with the light and color. Love the leading lines and there is enough detail in the subject to make it interesting.</td>', 'HDR works well in this with the light and color. Love the leading lines and there is enough detail in the subject to make it interesting.', '2012-05-09 16:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764856, 1014377, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice color and light.  I''m not sure the people on the left help it.  Still a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice color and light.  I''m not sure the people on the left help it.  Still a nice photo.', '2012-05-09 16:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764857, 1014462, 126709, '<td valign="top">Not moving me here.  The haze in the background blurs detail so the horizon kind of melts together.</td>', 'Not moving me here.  The haze in the background blurs detail so the horizon kind of melts together.', '2012-05-09 16:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764859, 1014210, 126709, '<td valign="top">Emotive with the sky and dead tree.  Just wish the wind were blowing a bit to bend the corn stalks.  Bump to 7.</td>', 'Emotive with the sky and dead tree.  Just wish the wind were blowing a bit to bend the corn stalks.  Bump to 7.', '2012-05-09 16:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764862, 1013942, 126709, '<td valign="top">I think you should have straightened the building.  With out the fish eye effect the building seems awkward to me.  I like the composition.</td>', 'I think you should have straightened the building.  With out the fish eye effect the building seems awkward to me.  I like the composition.', '2012-05-09 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764864, 1014464, 126709, '<td valign="top">Do you really want me to comment on this for a landscape photo?  Anyway, nice sharp eye on an ugly duck..  Good luck with the voters.  I still gave yo 6 for such a bold move.</td>', 'Do you really want me to comment on this for a landscape photo?  Anyway, nice sharp eye on an ugly duck..  Good luck with the voters.  I still gave yo 6 for such a bold move.', '2012-05-09 16:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764865, 1013408, 120663, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and composition of this picture. Excellent job. The water looks like silk flowing over the rocks.</td>', 'I love the lighting and composition of this picture. Excellent job. The water looks like silk flowing over the rocks.', '2012-05-09 16:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764866, 1014561, 126709, '<td valign="top">Great colors but I''m not sure about the composition or crop.  May be one of those locations where a few more minutes to let the light develop would make a huge difference.  Still a nice photo.</td>', 'Great colors but I''m not sure about the composition or crop.  May be one of those locations where a few more minutes to let the light develop would make a huge difference.  Still a nice photo.', '2012-05-09 16:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764867, 1014536, 120663, '<td valign="top">I am a lighthouse fan and I really enjoy the way that you captured this one. The lighting and foreground really add to the dramatic effect.</td>', 'I am a lighthouse fan and I really enjoy the way that you captured this one. The lighting and foreground really add to the dramatic effect.', '2012-05-09 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764868, 1014603, 126709, '<td valign="top">The birds bring this to life for me.  Maybe a little more detail recovery in the foreground trees would help it pop.</td>', 'The birds bring this to life for me.  Maybe a little more detail recovery in the foreground trees would help it pop.', '2012-05-09 16:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764870, 1014435, 126709, '<td valign="top">I love the sky but I think this is another one of those photos where waiting a bit to let the light develop (early evening) would make a big difference.</td>', 'I love the sky but I think this is another one of those photos where waiting a bit to let the light develop (early evening) would make a big difference.', '2012-05-09 16:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764871, 1014549, 126709, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t move me for a landscape.  Photojournalism maybe.  Sorry and good luck with the voters.  Still gave you a 6 for the attempt.</td>', 'Doesn''t move me for a landscape.  Photojournalism maybe.  Sorry and good luck with the voters.  Still gave you a 6 for the attempt.', '2012-05-09 16:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764872, 1014616, 126709, '<td valign="top">I think more DOF would help this.  Lots of foreground to contend with and it leads to a soft background.</td>', 'I think more DOF would help this.  Lots of foreground to contend with and it leads to a soft background.', '2012-05-09 16:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764873, 1014550, 120663, '<td valign="top">You took this at the exact right moment. Excellent surroundings and use of the lighthouse. The lighting is great. Excellent photo.</td>', 'You took this at the exact right moment. Excellent surroundings and use of the lighthouse. The lighting is great. Excellent photo.', '2012-05-09 16:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764876, 1014634, 126709, '<td valign="top">Good light considering the overcast sky.  However the diffused light takes all the depth/detail away in what I think would be a great clear sky evening light location.</td>', 'Good light considering the overcast sky.  However the diffused light takes all the depth/detail away in what I think would be a great clear sky evening light location.', '2012-05-09 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764881, 1014367, 126709, '<td valign="top">At first I wanted to say this was a DOF issue but after a second look I think the whole photo looks soft.  Hard to get real detail when the sky is providing a big soft box.  Nice composition and I would look at this location another day under different light if possible.</td>', 'At first I wanted to say this was a DOF issue but after a second look I think the whole photo looks soft.  Hard to get real detail when the sky is providing a big soft box.  Nice composition and I would look at this location another day under different light if possible.', '2012-05-09 16:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764882, 1014056, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very cool location with all the textures etc, but the processing is too extreme for my taste - and the sky does not match light below as if two or more layers were not blended correctly<br/> <br/>Ok - so you used an ND grad filter - it does not change the fact that your sky does not match the ground light so it looks like two separate images rather than one.  The sky is just too dark for the brightness of the light on the ground.  Cheers</td>', 'a very cool location with all the textures etc, but the processing is too extreme for my taste - and the sky does not match light below as if two or more layers were not blended correctly Ok - so you used an ND grad filter - it does not change the fact that your sky does not match the ground light so it looks like two separate images rather than one.  The sky is just too dark for the brightness of the light on the ground.  Cheers', '2012-05-09 16:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764885, 1014644, 126709, '<td valign="top">I cropped this on my screen with a piece of paper and like it better without the foreground.  I think the horizon should be the subject with just the old pier pilings leading to it.  Still a nice photo.</td>', 'I cropped this on my screen with a piece of paper and like it better without the foreground.  I think the horizon should be the subject with just the old pier pilings leading to it.  Still a nice photo.', '2012-05-09 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764886, 1014579, 126709, '<td valign="top">I love deep blue skies but can''t see this as a landscape photo.</td>', 'I love deep blue skies but can''t see this as a landscape photo.', '2012-05-09 16:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764887, 1014466, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice ND or long exposure shot.  The rock in the foreground is nice but with just a touch more light to highlight the edges more and provide a bit more detail to pop.  Still a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice ND or long exposure shot.  The rock in the foreground is nice but with just a touch more light to highlight the edges more and provide a bit more detail to pop.  Still a nice photo.', '2012-05-09 16:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764889, 1014492, 126709, '<td valign="top">Contemporary landscape?  I like the angles but it doesn''t compete with the traditional landscapes with me.  At least I''m honest.  Still gave a 6.  Good luck.</td>', 'Contemporary landscape?  I like the angles but it doesn''t compete with the traditional landscapes with me.  At least I''m honest.  Still gave a 6.  Good luck.', '2012-05-09 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764890, 1014612, 126709, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the saturation in the foreground.  Not saying it''s wrong, I just don''t care for it.  Nice composition though!</td>', 'I don''t care for the saturation in the foreground.  Not saying it''s wrong, I just don''t care for it.  Nice composition though!', '2012-05-09 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764893, 1014596, 126709, '<td valign="top">I know this is taken with some hard light and shadow but that makes it.  It has depth and color.  Well done.  Bump to 7.</td>', 'I know this is taken with some hard light and shadow but that makes it.  It has depth and color.  Well done.  Bump to 7.', '2012-05-09 16:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764895, 1014356, 126709, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of home. Nice photo.  I like it but I can make a connection.  Not sure everyone else will.  Good luck.</td>', 'Reminds me of home. Nice photo.  I like it but I can make a connection.  Not sure everyone else will.  Good luck.', '2012-05-09 16:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764899, 1014652, 126709, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see landscape in this and I think it''s a bit flat as far as light is concerned.  Nice sharp photo but I can''t make the connection.</td>', 'Can''t really see landscape in this and I think it''s a bit flat as far as light is concerned.  Nice sharp photo but I can''t make the connection.', '2012-05-09 16:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764900, 1014488, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but a bit heavy on the saturation on my screen.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition but a bit heavy on the saturation on my screen.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2012-05-09 16:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764901, 1014657, 126709, '<td valign="top">Different processing for a NYC skyline but a bit to contrasty for me.  Not a bad photo, just not my taste.</td>', 'Different processing for a NYC skyline but a bit to contrasty for me.  Not a bad photo, just not my taste.', '2012-05-09 16:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764903, 1014619, 126709, '<td valign="top">Different but not my cup of tea for landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Different but not my cup of tea for landscape.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2012-05-09 16:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764904, 1014658, 126709, '<td valign="top">6 for creativity!  Good luck!</td>', '6 for creativity!  Good luck!', '2012-05-09 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764905, 1014540, 126709, '<td valign="top">Overcast sky is killing this.  Needs light for contrast, detail, and depth.  Not a bad photo compositionally.</td>', 'Overcast sky is killing this.  Needs light for contrast, detail, and depth.  Not a bad photo compositionally.', '2012-05-09 16:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764907, 1014068, 126709, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I think dropping the highlights a bit would allow more detail in everything else.  It just overpowers the rest of the image.  The bright lights on the left and right not to mention the bridge steal all this has to offer.</td>', 'Nice shot but I think dropping the highlights a bit would allow more detail in everything else.  It just overpowers the rest of the image.  The bright lights on the left and right not to mention the bridge steal all this has to offer.', '2012-05-09 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764908, 1013526, 138253, '<td valign="top">Tree is too distracting.</td>', 'Tree is too distracting.', '2012-05-09 16:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764909, 1013862, 126709, '<td valign="top">Why do I feel like the wind is blowing when I look at this.  Hmmm, interesting photo.</td>', 'Why do I feel like the wind is blowing when I look at this.  Hmmm, interesting photo.', '2012-05-09 16:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764910, 1014498, 126709, '<td valign="top">A few more minutes to let the sun set a bit further on the horizon and I bet the colors jump in this photo.</td>', 'A few more minutes to let the sun set a bit further on the horizon and I bet the colors jump in this photo.', '2012-05-09 16:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764911, 1013381, 126709, '<td valign="top">Not a traditional landscape in my book but I like this.  Nice catch with the fog and what seems like perfect light for some detail.</td>', 'Not a traditional landscape in my book but I like this.  Nice catch with the fog and what seems like perfect light for some detail.', '2012-05-09 16:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764913, 1014296, 126709, '<td valign="top">Love the light and color in this but the composition doesn''t move me.</td>', 'Love the light and color in this but the composition doesn''t move me.', '2012-05-09 16:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764915, 1014411, 126709, '<td valign="top">One of those photos where dark works.  I cropped it on my screen with a piece of paper and I think a bit off the top and bottom really makes it work.  Maybe not so close to square as it is.</td>', 'One of those photos where dark works.  I cropped it on my screen with a piece of paper and I think a bit off the top and bottom really makes it work.  Maybe not so close to square as it is.', '2012-05-09 16:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764917, 1014425, 126709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and reflection of the sun.  Don''t care for the building but the rest of the scene is perfectly lit.  Bump to 7.</td>', 'Beautiful light and reflection of the sun.  Don''t care for the building but the rest of the scene is perfectly lit.  Bump to 7.', '2012-05-09 16:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764925, 1014644, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the horizon line on the upper rule of thirds area.  Harmoniously composed!  The old pier posts provide exquisite leading lines, which take the viewer out to the tranquil sea.    Exceptionally pleasant grain in the old wood, sand and pebbles.  Perfectly level horizon.  The sky and clouds are okay.  I think the overall image needs one more element of interest.  The leading lines of the old pier take the viewer out there and I find myself searching for "something".... a boat, an island, a light, a thunderstorm, a city skyline, etc.  Technically, this is great, with clarity and excellent sharpness in the details.  No detail lost in the shadows, nor the highlights.  That said, it might be a bit subdued with regards to light.  Yes, it''s dusk (or dawn) twilight.... but, some dynamic light might have created shadows and highlights to naturally punch up the energy.  For visual appeal, I have found my most successful landscape images to have a balance of red, green and blue colors.  I mean the scene is what it is.  But a green boat and some additional red tones in the sky would have balanced the dominant blue sea.  I like your title.  This is a very eye-pleasing image to view.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the horizon line on the upper rule of thirds area.  Harmoniously composed!  The old pier posts provide exquisite leading lines, which take the viewer out to the tranquil sea.    Exceptionally pleasant grain in the old wood, sand and pebbles.  Perfectly level horizon.  The sky and clouds are okay.  I think the overall image needs one more element of interest.  The leading lines of the old pier take the viewer out there and I find myself searching for "something".... a boat, an island, a light, a thunderstorm, a city skyline, etc.  Technically, this is great, with clarity and excellent sharpness in the details.  No detail lost in the shadows, nor the highlights.  That said, it might be a bit subdued with regards to light.  Yes, it''s dusk (or dawn) twilight.... but, some dynamic light might have created shadows and highlights to naturally punch up the energy.  For visual appeal, I have found my most successful landscape images to have a balance of red, green and blue colors.  I mean the scene is what it is.  But a green boat and some additional red tones in the sky would have balanced the dominant blue sea.  I like your title.  This is a very eye-pleasing image to view.', '2012-05-09 16:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764961, 1014056, 33672, '<td valign="top">A little too much processing....</td>', 'A little too much processing....', '2012-05-09 17:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764962, 1014489, 33672, '<td valign="top">Smooth!</td>', 'Smooth!', '2012-05-09 17:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6764969, 1014660, 27133, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote on this, the sky is too blue and the rocks are too red and the leaves are too green...and what is that leprachaun doing on the side of the image....!!!</td>', 'I can''t vote on this, the sky is too blue and the rocks are too red and the leaves are too green...and what is that leprachaun doing on the side of the image....!!!', '2012-05-09 17:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765007, 1014489, 108580, '<td valign="top">I know those hills :) Great study and simple basic colours make the trees stand out. Super POV.</td>', 'I know those hills :) Great study and simple basic colours make the trees stand out. Super POV.', '2012-05-09 19:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765008, 1014644, 108580, '<td valign="top">More of a seascape than a landscape but who''s complaining :) There is a little bit of land in it. great compo and light.</td>', 'More of a seascape than a landscape but who''s complaining :) There is a little bit of land in it. great compo and light.', '2012-05-09 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765009, 1014550, 108580, '<td valign="top">Super image, a bit OTT but effective all the same. Appealing.</td>', 'Super image, a bit OTT but effective all the same. Appealing.', '2012-05-09 19:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765016, 1014578, 137576, '<td valign="top">nickyb??</td>', 'nickyb??', '2012-05-09 19:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765019, 1014559, 137576, '<td valign="top">best yet 10</td>', 'best yet 10', '2012-05-09 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765059, 1014550, 147476, '<td valign="top">This image is mesmerizing. The colors are balanced and grounding.</td>', 'This image is mesmerizing. The colors are balanced and grounding.', '2012-05-09 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765129, 1013408, 148307, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of photo I can lose myself</td>', 'This is the kind of photo I can lose myself', '2012-05-09 22:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765210, 1014645, 129807, '<td valign="top">Gee, I wish I could vote on this one, but I can''t. The tree is obviously lonely but enjoying its solitude; the smaller shrubs in the foreground seem to be echoes radiating from it. That buttery smooth tonality of the sky is simply fabulous. The only nitpick I have is the tree/house/pole thing on the horizon - it looks a bit like an emu sticking it''s head up.</td>', 'Gee, I wish I could vote on this one, but I can''t. The tree is obviously lonely but enjoying its solitude; the smaller shrubs in the foreground seem to be echoes radiating from it. That buttery smooth tonality of the sky is simply fabulous. The only nitpick I have is the tree/house/pole thing on the horizon - it looks a bit like an emu sticking it''s head up.', '2012-05-10 00:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765216, 1014550, 62357, '<td valign="top">Interesting that there are two Perch Rock entries in this challenge.  Nice reflection</td>', 'Interesting that there are two Perch Rock entries in this challenge.  Nice reflection', '2012-05-10 00:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765304, 1014299, 141826, '<td valign="top">Simply beatiful........</td>', 'Simply beatiful........', '2012-05-10 05:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765305, 1014260, 141826, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.....</td>', 'Beautiful.....', '2012-05-10 05:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765313, 1014008, 101668, '<td valign="top">I am not sure that this will go through as portrayal of a landscape and I am not a B?W fan. Good lighting here though</td>', 'I am not sure that this will go through as portrayal of a landscape and I am not a B?W fan. Good lighting here though', '2012-05-10 05:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765314, 1014645, 101668, '<td valign="top">Colours are flat but I like the minimalism in here. Not too sure what is on the horizon?</td>', 'Colours are flat but I like the minimalism in here. Not too sure what is on the horizon?', '2012-05-10 05:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765316, 1014561, 101668, '<td valign="top">Interesting pov and lovely colours but uninteresting picture overall</td>', 'Interesting pov and lovely colours but uninteresting picture overall', '2012-05-10 06:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765317, 1014382, 101668, '<td valign="top">Lovely layers very nice</td>', 'Lovely layers very nice', '2012-05-10 06:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
