(6765852, 1014644, 29748, '<td valign="top">Oh what a nice scene.  Excellent use of leading lines.</td>', 'Oh what a nice scene.  Excellent use of leading lines.', '2012-05-10 14:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765874, 1014371, 137320, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this. Very clever. My highest mark so far.</td>', 'Absolutely love this. Very clever. My highest mark so far.', '2012-05-10 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765884, 1014543, 137320, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. I like it!</td>', 'Very cool idea. I like it!', '2012-05-10 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765885, 1013599, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not really a landscape, is it?  I like it, despite that.</td>', 'Not really a landscape, is it?  I like it, despite that.', '2012-05-10 14:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765886, 1014425, 142473, '<td valign="top">If you could have cut out the building, I think it would have been a major improvement.</td>', 'If you could have cut out the building, I think it would have been a major improvement.', '2012-05-10 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765887, 1014494, 142473, '<td valign="top">Lovely, albeit a tad dark overall.</td>', 'Lovely, albeit a tad dark overall.', '2012-05-10 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765888, 1014262, 142473, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but maybe a bit too much zoom for a landscape challenge.</td>', 'A nice shot, but maybe a bit too much zoom for a landscape challenge.', '2012-05-10 14:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765889, 1014435, 142473, '<td valign="top">Really nice, just wish the center tree was full.  Great clouds.</td>', 'Really nice, just wish the center tree was full.  Great clouds.', '2012-05-10 14:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765891, 1014582, 142473, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like the grass, but I think the image needed something like that.  Too bad it wasn''t some wild reeds or something.</td>', 'At first I didn''t like the grass, but I think the image needed something like that.  Too bad it wasn''t some wild reeds or something.', '2012-05-10 14:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765894, 1014210, 137320, '<td valign="top">Shot is good, love the aperture. Subject matter is really cool... but the editing in my opinion really makes this shot. Absolutely gorgeous tones and contrast. 9</td>', 'Shot is good, love the aperture. Subject matter is really cool... but the editing in my opinion really makes this shot. Absolutely gorgeous tones and contrast. 9', '2012-05-10 14:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765895, 1014354, 142473, '<td valign="top">Gorgous.  Some ol granite really does make a great landscape.  Great inclusion of the moon and waterfall.</td>', 'Gorgous.  Some ol granite really does make a great landscape.  Great inclusion of the moon and waterfall.', '2012-05-10 14:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765897, 1014491, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is very moving. It''s one that requires more than just a quick glance to appreciate. 8!</td>', 'This is very moving. It''s one that requires more than just a quick glance to appreciate. 8!', '2012-05-10 14:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765898, 1014480, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the processing, it''s not bad, but I don''t tend to like glow like that between the ridges.  Might have worked better if the glow radius was much larger, so it spread out the gradient more.</td>', 'Not sure about the processing, it''s not bad, but I don''t tend to like glow like that between the ridges.  Might have worked better if the glow radius was much larger, so it spread out the gradient more.', '2012-05-10 14:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765900, 1014210, 142473, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Great tones and processing.  I even like the path on the left, which balances the tree perfectly.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Great tones and processing.  I even like the path on the left, which balances the tree perfectly.', '2012-05-10 14:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765901, 1013884, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the processing.</td>', 'Not a fan of the processing.', '2012-05-10 14:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765902, 1014536, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous. Love the foreground, the light emerging from behind the lighthouse and the vignetting to pull it all together. 9!</td>', 'This is gorgeous. Love the foreground, the light emerging from behind the lighthouse and the vignetting to pull it all together. 9!', '2012-05-10 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765903, 1014462, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice shot road dog... looks like a very low vantage point, did you mount it to the bumper or something?</td>', 'Nice shot road dog... looks like a very low vantage point, did you mount it to the bumper or something?', '2012-05-10 14:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765904, 1014464, 142473, '<td valign="top">Landscape?</td>', 'Landscape?', '2012-05-10 14:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765905, 1014596, 142473, '<td valign="top">Really nice except for the power lines.</td>', 'Really nice except for the power lines.', '2012-05-10 14:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765907, 1014440, 142473, '<td valign="top">To me, this needs a little more thought behind the composition, and maybe a little more saturation.  Bring out that red roof and the pink flowers more.</td>', 'To me, this needs a little more thought behind the composition, and maybe a little more saturation.  Bring out that red roof and the pink flowers more.', '2012-05-10 14:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765909, 1013731, 137320, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. The tones, the contrast, the flawless mist. I gave it a 9!</td>', 'I absolutely love this. The tones, the contrast, the flawless mist. I gave it a 9!', '2012-05-10 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765910, 1014658, 142473, '<td valign="top">Hilarious, but not sure how to score it.</td>', 'Hilarious, but not sure how to score it.', '2012-05-10 14:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765915, 1014050, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting, the blurring gives it almost a miniature effect.  Actually, nicely done.  Though I think the title should have been "wonderland".  I''m going to vote as if it were.</td>', 'Interesting, the blurring gives it almost a miniature effect.  Actually, nicely done.  Though I think the title should have been "wonderland".  I''m going to vote as if it were.', '2012-05-10 14:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765917, 1014498, 142473, '<td valign="top">Really nice, but the horizon isn''t level... :(</td>', 'Really nice, but the horizon isn''t level... :(', '2012-05-10 14:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765918, 1014176, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great processing to capture all of that at once.  Not the perfect setting, but not bad either.  Maybe a person at the picknick table would add a certain something extra?</td>', 'Great processing to capture all of that at once.  Not the perfect setting, but not bad either.  Maybe a person at the picknick table would add a certain something extra?', '2012-05-10 14:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765919, 1014613, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great composition and setting.  Not sure about the coloring.  Feels off to me a bit.  Overall I really like it though.</td>', 'Great composition and setting.  Not sure about the coloring.  Feels off to me a bit.  Overall I really like it though.', '2012-05-10 14:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765920, 1014299, 142473, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I''m guessing Florida... but I''m probably off.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I''m guessing Florida... but I''m probably off.', '2012-05-10 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765923, 1014559, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. The sharpness and cool tones really do it for me. It''s a shame the foreground isn''t just flawless green grass. Still very beautiful, an 8 from me!</td>', 'This is awesome. The sharpness and cool tones really do it for me. It''s a shame the foreground isn''t just flawless green grass. Still very beautiful, an 8 from me!', '2012-05-10 14:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765930, 1014176, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! The tones in places seam a little off, but the rest is perfect. Love the saturation and clouds. 7 from me.</td>', 'This is gorgeous! The tones in places seam a little off, but the rest is perfect. Love the saturation and clouds. 7 from me.', '2012-05-10 14:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765932, 1014377, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is so dreamy. Love the clarity being low enough to give off that "other worldly" vibe, but still sharp enough to give beautiful definition in the mountains. The people on the left bumped it from an 8 to a 9 :)</td>', 'This is so dreamy. Love the clarity being low enough to give off that "other worldly" vibe, but still sharp enough to give beautiful definition in the mountains. The people on the left bumped it from an 8 to a 9 :)', '2012-05-10 14:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765935, 1014577, 137320, '<td valign="top">The processing seems just a tad off. The clouds (background) are darker than the foreground which is a little distracting. But I love the contrast, composition and subject matter. 7 from me.</td>', 'The processing seems just a tad off. The clouds (background) are darker than the foreground which is a little distracting. But I love the contrast, composition and subject matter. 7 from me.', '2012-05-10 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765944, 1014550, 137320, '<td valign="top">LOVE the colors in this. The brown from the sky hitting the brown of the ground, then leading to the symmetrical sky/reflection, to me deserves high marks. 9, and I really hope this ribbons.</td>', 'LOVE the colors in this. The brown from the sky hitting the brown of the ground, then leading to the symmetrical sky/reflection, to me deserves high marks. 9, and I really hope this ribbons.', '2012-05-10 14:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6765994, 1014578, 65319, '<td valign="top">What a lovely lake with swans...I''d love to see this image prior to the processing which bothers me a little bit.</td>', 'What a lovely lake with swans...I''d love to see this image prior to the processing which bothers me a little bit.', '2012-05-10 16:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766003, 1013599, 65319, '<td valign="top">In this set of images...coming across this one is rather refreshing...8</td>', 'In this set of images...coming across this one is rather refreshing...8', '2012-05-10 16:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766004, 1014658, 65319, '<td valign="top">I''d really like to see a little more sky drama in this image...;-P</td>', 'I''d really like to see a little more sky drama in this image...;-P', '2012-05-10 16:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766050, 1013306, 96721, '<td valign="top">I quite like this one I think a slightly closer crop on the right might have strengthened the image though as I don''t think that area adds anything to the shot but is a bit distracting as I want to look down the valley but keep getting drawn back to that space, plus the tighter crop leads my eye up to the hut then nicely down the hill and in to the shot.<br/> <br/>Scored 6 might come back later to +/- 1</td>', 'I quite like this one I think a slightly closer crop on the right might have strengthened the image though as I don''t think that area adds anything to the shot but is a bit distracting as I want to look down the valley but keep getting drawn back to that space, plus the tighter crop leads my eye up to the hut then nicely down the hill and in to the shot. Scored 6 might come back later to +/- 1', '2012-05-10 17:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766051, 1014355, 96721, '<td valign="top">I personally feel this is slightly overdone, with a bit more subtlety in the processing I could have seen me voting this an 8 or maybe even 9 as it is I think it''ll be a 6 - might be back later to +/- 1<br/> <br/>Such a lovely scene!</td>', 'I personally feel this is slightly overdone, with a bit more subtlety in the processing I could have seen me voting this an 8 or maybe even 9 as it is I think it''ll be a 6 - might be back later to +/- 1 Such a lovely scene!', '2012-05-10 17:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766052, 1014489, 96721, '<td valign="top">I love this, nice and simple yet the more I look the more is revealed, very nice!<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'I love this, nice and simple yet the more I look the more is revealed, very nice! 8', '2012-05-10 17:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766053, 1014435, 96721, '<td valign="top">Love the layers on this shot but I really feel there must have been a slightly better angle for the shot, the middle layer is just too obscured by the front trees for me, obviously this is just my opinion and I hope it doesn''t offend...<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'Love the layers on this shot but I really feel there must have been a slightly better angle for the shot, the middle layer is just too obscured by the front trees for me, obviously this is just my opinion and I hope it doesn''t offend... 6', '2012-05-10 17:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766055, 1014603, 96721, '<td valign="top">This is actually very nice I love that the detail in the sky was not forced out and it''s perfectly subtle for my taste.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'This is actually very nice I love that the detail in the sky was not forced out and it''s perfectly subtle for my taste. 8', '2012-05-10 17:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766057, 1014480, 96721, '<td valign="top">I like this but those halos are so distracting :( Also I might have edited the sky to try and reduce the detail and contrasts in it, for me it just makes an otherwise serene shot a bit cluttered.<br/> <br/>Gorgeous scene though<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'I like this but those halos are so distracting :( Also I might have edited the sky to try and reduce the detail and contrasts in it, for me it just makes an otherwise serene shot a bit cluttered. Gorgeous scene though 5', '2012-05-10 17:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766059, 1014408, 96721, '<td valign="top">I like the scene, wonder if it might have been much more of a shot with just a lone figure out there almost in contemplation, but you had what you had :)<br/> <br/>Looking again I wonder if the leftside could be cropped in by an inch or so not sure it''s needed (in my opinion of course).<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'I like the scene, wonder if it might have been much more of a shot with just a lone figure out there almost in contemplation, but you had what you had :) Looking again I wonder if the leftside could be cropped in by an inch or so not sure it''s needed (in my opinion of course). 6', '2012-05-10 17:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766065, 1013526, 96721, '<td valign="top">Not to my taste sorry, I find there''s far too much sky but then the foreground - midground is very cluttered, I can see what the idea of the tree was but personally I don''t think it worked quite right.<br/> <br/>4</td>', 'Not to my taste sorry, I find there''s far too much sky but then the foreground - midground is very cluttered, I can see what the idea of the tree was but personally I don''t think it worked quite right. 4', '2012-05-10 17:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766067, 1014494, 96721, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and I''d love to see this in the top ten.<br/> <br/>Love the diagonal of stream, the trees stop that wonderfully, the sky is beautifully detailed and the subtle layers in the middle of the picture are very pleasing.<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Beautiful and I''d love to see this in the top ten. Love the diagonal of stream, the trees stop that wonderfully, the sky is beautifully detailed and the subtle layers in the middle of the picture are very pleasing. 9', '2012-05-10 18:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766077, 1014559, 96721, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the saturation, love the slow shutter speed for light trails, can definitely see this on the front page.<br/> <br/>Bumped to 10</td>', 'Very nice, love the saturation, love the slow shutter speed for light trails, can definitely see this on the front page. Bumped to 10', '2012-05-10 18:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766078, 1014491, 96721, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, back to bump to 10<br/> <br/>love the softness and the subtle toning.</td>', 'This is beautiful, back to bump to 10 love the softness and the subtle toning.', '2012-05-10 18:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766079, 1013795, 96721, '<td valign="top">I love this and hope to see it in the top ten.<br/> <br/>The curves of the middle fence playing against the straight lines of the front fence and the almost perfect line of trees in the background it just works for me. Lovely processing too.<br/> <br/>Bumped to 9</td>', 'I love this and hope to see it in the top ten. The curves of the middle fence playing against the straight lines of the front fence and the almost perfect line of trees in the background it just works for me. Lovely processing too. Bumped to 9', '2012-05-10 18:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766080, 1014371, 96721, '<td valign="top">Another very nice shot, love the softness of the corn in the foreground against that stunning sky.<br/> <br/>A slight distraction on the right is that metal building and I feel that could have been cropped without losing and of the composition.<br/> <br/>Bumped to 9</td>', 'Another very nice shot, love the softness of the corn in the foreground against that stunning sky. A slight distraction on the right is that metal building and I feel that could have been cropped without losing and of the composition. Bumped to 9', '2012-05-10 18:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766081, 1014617, 96721, '<td valign="top">Refreshingly different, lovely shot<br/> <br/>Bumped to 9</td>', 'Refreshingly different, lovely shot Bumped to 9', '2012-05-10 18:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766082, 1013783, 96721, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous layers in this, love the soft focus and the colours are very very nice. Hopefully top ten.<br/> <br/>Bumped 9</td>', 'Gorgeous layers in this, love the soft focus and the colours are very very nice. Hopefully top ten. Bumped 9', '2012-05-10 18:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766083, 1014356, 96721, '<td valign="top">I find this shot very pleasing to look at, reminds me of a trip to France I just feel I have travelled this road :) Very nice<br/> <br/>Bumped 9</td>', 'I find this shot very pleasing to look at, reminds me of a trip to France I just feel I have travelled this road :) Very nice Bumped 9', '2012-05-10 18:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766084, 1014630, 96721, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections and I have been saying a lot of shots are over processed, however in the case of this shot I feel it works - the textures are just great, I love the contrasts from the tree line and the sky and talking of the sky that colour is gorgeous!<br/> <br/>I''d stab a guess this might be Bear_Music but could be wrong.<br/> <br/>Bumped 8</td>', 'I love the reflections and I have been saying a lot of shots are over processed, however in the case of this shot I feel it works - the textures are just great, I love the contrasts from the tree line and the sky and talking of the sky that colour is gorgeous! I''d stab a guess this might be Bear_Music but could be wrong. Bumped 8', '2012-05-10 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766085, 1014486, 96721, '<td valign="top">Another pleasing scene, the leading lines are very nice and I quite like the processing. Good shot!<br/> <br/>Bumped 8</td>', 'Another pleasing scene, the leading lines are very nice and I quite like the processing. Good shot! Bumped 8', '2012-05-10 18:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766100, 1014063, 34192, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the foreground included but the partial tree doesn''t enhance the image. It throws it off balance a little. 7</td>', 'I appreciate the foreground included but the partial tree doesn''t enhance the image. It throws it off balance a little. 7', '2012-05-10 19:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766101, 1014619, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find this pleasant if a little imbalanced. The processing, in this case, helps a lot with the mood. 6</td>', 'I find this pleasant if a little imbalanced. The processing, in this case, helps a lot with the mood. 6', '2012-05-10 19:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766102, 1014371, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground interest though I think it is a little overwhelming to the rest of the scene. I keep wanting the camera to pan to the left, as if there might be something of greater interest over there. 6</td>', 'I like the foreground interest though I think it is a little overwhelming to the rest of the scene. I keep wanting the camera to pan to the left, as if there might be something of greater interest over there. 6', '2012-05-10 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766103, 1014613, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, well exposed.  I feel it is missing something, something that ties me to the picture.  Right now, looking at it, I feel I am on a train looking out the window rather than actually there. Kind of ''once-removed'' so to speak. 6</td>', 'Pretty scene, well exposed.  I feel it is missing something, something that ties me to the picture.  Right now, looking at it, I feel I am on a train looking out the window rather than actually there. Kind of ''once-removed'' so to speak. 6', '2012-05-10 19:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766104, 1014658, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love this.  It is whimsical and fun, and honestly, composed and lit well. Wish the depth of field was a little greater. 8</td>', 'I love this.  It is whimsical and fun, and honestly, composed and lit well. Wish the depth of field was a little greater. 8', '2012-05-10 19:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766106, 1014083, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, good use of natural lighting. You gave me space to move into the scene, rather than a view from a window - I appreciate that. Could use a bump in saturation and contrast but, for the most part, very well taken. 8</td>', 'Very well composed, good use of natural lighting. You gave me space to move into the scene, rather than a view from a window - I appreciate that. Could use a bump in saturation and contrast but, for the most part, very well taken. 8', '2012-05-10 19:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766107, 1014486, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this image, though I think I would love it with the left 20% gone.  It is both soft and sharp, making it feel very natural, in spite of the coloring. I think, also, if the point of view were just a little lower, bringing the foreground closer, I would have really loved it. overall, very nice. 7</td>', 'I like this image, though I think I would love it with the left 20% gone.  It is both soft and sharp, making it feel very natural, in spite of the coloring. I think, also, if the point of view were just a little lower, bringing the foreground closer, I would have really loved it. overall, very nice. 7', '2012-05-10 19:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766108, 1013809, 34192, '<td valign="top">Nice, well taken capture with optimal use of natural light. It could use just a touch of sharpening in the closer areas (I think a larger depth of field may have suited here), and just a little punch of saturation in the greens and reds to make the image ''pop.'' 7</td>', 'Nice, well taken capture with optimal use of natural light. It could use just a touch of sharpening in the closer areas (I think a larger depth of field may have suited here), and just a little punch of saturation in the greens and reds to make the image ''pop.'' 7', '2012-05-10 19:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766114, 1013710, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this.  The longer that I look the more that becomes apparent. But I don''t think it is enough.  It needs just a touch more depth to grab me at first look so that I don''t just pass it by. Just a little touch more contrast and it would be perfect (for me) I think. 7</td>', 'I really want to like this.  The longer that I look the more that becomes apparent. But I don''t think it is enough.  It needs just a touch more depth to grab me at first look so that I don''t just pass it by. Just a little touch more contrast and it would be perfect (for me) I think. 7', '2012-05-10 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766115, 1014435, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty enough.  Would be improved with some foreground of interest. 6</td>', 'Pretty enough.  Would be improved with some foreground of interest. 6', '2012-05-10 19:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766116, 1014050, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a pretty scene if the spotty (vignette maybe?) blur wasn''t so distracting. It is well balanced and composed. I think the editing also muddied the colors in some spots but not others.</td>', 'I think this could be a pretty scene if the spotty (vignette maybe?) blur wasn''t so distracting. It is well balanced and composed. I think the editing also muddied the colors in some spots but not others.', '2012-05-10 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766117, 1014659, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is intended to be black and white but I think color would be an asset to the image.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is intended to be black and white but I think color would be an asset to the image.', '2012-05-10 20:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766119, 1014624, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think just a slight curves adjustment would help this image - it would allow a little more light into it.  There is an awful lot of stuff here but, being that it is all reduced to tones (by virtue of it being black and white) it is hard to make out just what is what, to separate the parts of the image from each other.</td>', 'I think just a slight curves adjustment would help this image - it would allow a little more light into it.  There is an awful lot of stuff here but, being that it is all reduced to tones (by virtue of it being black and white) it is hard to make out just what is what, to separate the parts of the image from each other.', '2012-05-10 20:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766120, 1014579, 34192, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors but really nothing of interest for me to grab onto.  I think I would appreciate it more if it was just the sky.</td>', 'Pretty colors but really nothing of interest for me to grab onto.  I think I would appreciate it more if it was just the sky.', '2012-05-10 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766121, 1014411, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the blur here helps the image - it just muddies up everything until you have solely mid-tones and no contract.  The composition might be nice, but I really can''t tell.</td>', 'I don''t think the blur here helps the image - it just muddies up everything until you have solely mid-tones and no contract.  The composition might be nice, but I really can''t tell.', '2012-05-10 20:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766122, 1014008, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the black and white treatment serves this image well, though I really can''t guess as to what color the grass or the fence may have been. The point of view is standard - I''m guessing an adult aiming slightly down. Maybe from a different point of view I would appreciate it more.</td>', 'I''m not sure the black and white treatment serves this image well, though I really can''t guess as to what color the grass or the fence may have been. The point of view is standard - I''m guessing an adult aiming slightly down. Maybe from a different point of view I would appreciate it more.', '2012-05-10 20:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766123, 1014488, 34192, '<td valign="top">A pretty scene though I am overwhelmed by the hyper-saturation.</td>', 'A pretty scene though I am overwhelmed by the hyper-saturation.', '2012-05-10 20:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766124, 1014578, 34192, '<td valign="top">A difficult scene to work with.  As a photographer, I would want to ''get down'' so it doesn''t appear that I am standing over the subjects but I would also be conscious of the back ground, which has a great amount of interest in and of itself. I think you did it well, considering the limitations you must have been working with. Something in the editing feels a little off though - I''m not sure.  It feels like guassian blur was added.  Whatever it is, it removes the naturalness of the scene (for me). At any rate, I find the image interesting. Thanks! 6</td>', 'A difficult scene to work with.  As a photographer, I would want to ''get down'' so it doesn''t appear that I am standing over the subjects but I would also be conscious of the back ground, which has a great amount of interest in and of itself. I think you did it well, considering the limitations you must have been working with. Something in the editing feels a little off though - I''m not sure.  It feels like guassian blur was added.  Whatever it is, it removes the naturalness of the scene (for me). At any rate, I find the image interesting. Thanks! 6', '2012-05-10 20:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766125, 1014056, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m really not a fan of the editing - I don''t think it serves the image well. That aside, I think you found an excellent place to take this, and composed it very well.  You made good use of what I can see of the natural lighting.</td>', 'I''m really not a fan of the editing - I don''t think it serves the image well. That aside, I think you found an excellent place to take this, and composed it very well.  You made good use of what I can see of the natural lighting.', '2012-05-10 20:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766131, 1014408, 121564, '<td valign="top">it beautiful,but the horizon is a little skew</td>', 'it beautiful,but the horizon is a little skew', '2012-05-10 20:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
