(6766249, 1014064, 69008, '<td valign="top">That''s the correct title. The moon is a fascinating place to explore with a good telescope.</td>', 'That''s the correct title. The moon is a fascinating place to explore with a good telescope.', '2012-05-10 23:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
