(6766251, 1014309, 145829, '<td valign="top">nice reflection, but I would straighten the photo and remove the plant from the foreground that is blurred.</td>', 'nice reflection, but I would straighten the photo and remove the plant from the foreground that is blurred.', '2012-05-10 23:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766252, 1014198, 69008, '<td valign="top">Nice framing with the trees. The sky reminds me of London England.</td>', 'Nice framing with the trees. The sky reminds me of London England.', '2012-05-10 23:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766262, 1013323, 69008, '<td valign="top">My first thought about this is that I would have tried different viewpoints, probably ending up shooting from more to your left, to get a leading line with the spit of land coming from the corner or bottom of the image. It looks as if it was late in the day with a sprinkle of rain going on.</td>', 'My first thought about this is that I would have tried different viewpoints, probably ending up shooting from more to your left, to get a leading line with the spit of land coming from the corner or bottom of the image. It looks as if it was late in the day with a sprinkle of rain going on.', '2012-05-10 23:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766265, 1014492, 69008, '<td valign="top">I don''t take this one "lightly".     It''s not a voter friendly looking shot, but I like it for content and structure/comp.</td>', 'I don''t take this one "lightly".     It''s not a voter friendly looking shot, but I like it for content and structure/comp.', '2012-05-10 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766267, 1014065, 69008, '<td valign="top">This one looks generally a little too dark for my taste. This scene has huge potential for shooting on the right day and hour.  I do like the B&amp;W for this one.</td>', 'This one looks generally a little too dark for my taste. This scene has huge potential for shooting on the right day and hour.  I do like the B&W for this one.', '2012-05-10 23:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766271, 1014259, 69008, '<td valign="top">The side lighting is good in this one. I esp like the way the one window stands out.</td>', 'The side lighting is good in this one. I esp like the way the one window stands out.', '2012-05-10 23:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766274, 1014063, 69008, '<td valign="top">I was studying this one thinking "this looks like Miami" then I saw the title. One of those roaring red sunsets would have kicked this one up a couple of notches.</td>', 'I was studying this one thinking "this looks like Miami" then I saw the title. One of those roaring red sunsets would have kicked this one up a couple of notches.', '2012-05-10 23:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766275, 1014652, 69008, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty, and I feel like I''m there when I look at this one.</td>', 'It''s pretty, and I feel like I''m there when I look at this one.', '2012-05-10 23:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766277, 1013795, 69008, '<td valign="top">I''m uncomfortable with the unexpected fence in the foreground. It does add to the composition, but it does not seem to justify breaking up the flow of the marvelous field of wild flowers.  I do like the tree line, the second fence, and sky in this one.</td>', 'I''m uncomfortable with the unexpected fence in the foreground. It does add to the composition, but it does not seem to justify breaking up the flow of the marvelous field of wild flowers.  I do like the tree line, the second fence, and sky in this one.', '2012-05-10 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766278, 1014658, 69008, '<td valign="top">I gave you a good vote for the effort to shoot this one.  I like the daffodils.</td>', 'I gave you a good vote for the effort to shoot this one.  I like the daffodils.', '2012-05-10 23:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766279, 1013805, 69008, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I wish I knew what the yellow stuff is. You had the perfect sky for this.</td>', 'Very nice.  I wish I knew what the yellow stuff is. You had the perfect sky for this.', '2012-05-10 23:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766280, 1014489, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of grand depth in this one.</td>', 'I like the feel of grand depth in this one.', '2012-05-11 00:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766281, 1014411, 69008, '<td valign="top">Dark and broody, and very moody.</td>', 'Dark and broody, and very moody.', '2012-05-11 00:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766283, 1014619, 69008, '<td valign="top">Lovely light with grainy coolness.</td>', 'Lovely light with grainy coolness.', '2012-05-11 00:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766285, 1014408, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good scene and wonderful sky. The horizon probably got you some dings in the voting though.  I want to go here.</td>', 'Good scene and wonderful sky. The horizon probably got you some dings in the voting though.  I want to go here.', '2012-05-11 00:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766287, 1014624, 69008, '<td valign="top">A little more light on the right would have improved this one for me.  It''s the kind of scene that I  like to visit though.</td>', 'A little more light on the right would have improved this one for me.  It''s the kind of scene that I  like to visit though.', '2012-05-11 00:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766289, 1014376, 69008, '<td valign="top">I''m looking for something to latch on to in the foreground, but it just isn''t there. It seems to need something of interest close up to anchor the scene before following the long leading shoreline.</td>', 'I''m looking for something to latch on to in the foreground, but it just isn''t there. It seems to need something of interest close up to anchor the scene before following the long leading shoreline.', '2012-05-11 00:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766290, 1014354, 69008, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. It looks like Colorado, or Montana.</td>', 'Nicely done. It looks like Colorado, or Montana.', '2012-05-11 00:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766291, 1014559, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like the glow that''s backlighting the mountain in this one.</td>', 'I like the glow that''s backlighting the mountain in this one.', '2012-05-11 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766293, 1014367, 69008, '<td valign="top">Using a much smaller aperture and focusing closer to get the flowers in focus with lots of DOF to keep the mountain tops would have made this much nicer.  It''s a pretty spot though, and I like the hazy light there.</td>', 'Using a much smaller aperture and focusing closer to get the flowers in focus with lots of DOF to keep the mountain tops would have made this much nicer.  It''s a pretty spot though, and I like the hazy light there.', '2012-05-11 00:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766294, 1014435, 69008, '<td valign="top">Majestic. A polarizer would have made this one sparkle.</td>', 'Majestic. A polarizer would have made this one sparkle.', '2012-05-11 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766296, 1014176, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good processing , esp the sky, in this one.</td>', 'Good processing , esp the sky, in this one.', '2012-05-11 00:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
