(6766315, 1014094, 69008, '<td valign="top">Ha, a road-scape.  This one will do well for the awesome leading line, and maybe get dinged for sharpness.</td>', 'Ha, a road-scape.  This one will do well for the awesome leading line, and maybe get dinged for sharpness.', '2012-05-11 00:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766318, 1014557, 69008, '<td valign="top">A polarizer would have made this one stronger by increasing contrast and darkening the blue sky.</td>', 'A polarizer would have made this one stronger by increasing contrast and darkening the blue sky.', '2012-05-11 00:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766321, 1014488, 69008, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene. The jumper is a nice minimalist touch too.</td>', 'Pretty scene. The jumper is a nice minimalist touch too.', '2012-05-11 00:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766322, 1013526, 69008, '<td valign="top">That must be a tough place to live. I like that you found some  plants to use in the foreground.</td>', 'That must be a tough place to live. I like that you found some  plants to use in the foreground.', '2012-05-11 00:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766324, 1014382, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful scene. The color is a little on the strong side.  This may get a validation request because of the moon phase and position near Venus.</td>', 'This is a beautiful scene. The color is a little on the strong side.  This may get a validation request because of the moon phase and position near Venus.', '2012-05-11 00:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766326, 1014405, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good seeing.</td>', 'Good seeing.', '2012-05-11 00:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766328, 1014498, 69008, '<td valign="top">Take time to level the camera more carefully and scores will improve.  I like the scene.</td>', 'Take time to level the camera more carefully and scores will improve.  I like the scene.', '2012-05-11 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766333, 1014589, 69008, '<td valign="top">Safe harbor. Not much land to scape here, but I like the scene.</td>', 'Safe harbor. Not much land to scape here, but I like the scene.', '2012-05-11 00:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766349, 1014056, 69008, '<td valign="top">The gradient is overdone in this one. This is an interesting scene and the road makes a good leading line.</td>', 'The gradient is overdone in this one. This is an interesting scene and the road makes a good leading line.', '2012-05-11 00:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766350, 1014050, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good "dapple".</td>', 'Good "dapple".', '2012-05-11 00:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766352, 1014494, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. It''s a little dark overall but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'I like this one a lot. It''s a little dark overall but otherwise very nice.', '2012-05-11 00:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766354, 1014660, 69008, '<td valign="top">Yes it is.</td>', 'Yes it is.', '2012-05-11 00:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766356, 1013862, 69008, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not eye candy. I like the way the one tree curves under the arch.</td>', 'Interesting, but not eye candy. I like the way the one tree curves under the arch.', '2012-05-11 00:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766357, 1014605, 69008, '<td valign="top">This one was processed pretty hard. Nice scene.</td>', 'This one was processed pretty hard. Nice scene.', '2012-05-11 00:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766358, 1014631, 69008, '<td valign="top">What a cool looking scene.  Big score for the way the sky and scape compliment each other here.</td>', 'What a cool looking scene.  Big score for the way the sky and scape compliment each other here.', '2012-05-11 00:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766359, 1014550, 69008, '<td valign="top">Lightening up the reflection of the lighthouse a little would have made this one look more real.  Good sky though and the scene is interesting.</td>', 'Lightening up the reflection of the lighthouse a little would have made this one look more real.  Good sky though and the scene is interesting.', '2012-05-11 00:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766360, 1014507, 69008, '<td valign="top">Pinhole lens?  Blur will get this one clobbered in voting. Personally, i like the dreamy look for this.</td>', 'Pinhole lens?  Blur will get this one clobbered in voting. Personally, i like the dreamy look for this.', '2012-05-11 00:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766361, 1014280, 69008, '<td valign="top">The one tree top directly below the moon in this looks like it was blurred in editing. It keeps pulling my eye back to that spot in the image.  Otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'The one tree top directly below the moon in this looks like it was blurred in editing. It keeps pulling my eye back to that spot in the image.  Otherwise, very nice.', '2012-05-11 00:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766362, 1014464, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but will probably get clobbered as a DNMC.</td>', 'Good photo, but will probably get clobbered as a DNMC.', '2012-05-11 00:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766368, 1013801, 69008, '<td valign="top">The main point of interest here, the concrete ditch does not make me want to "step into the picture".   The composition concept is good, just not a good subject for it.</td>', 'The main point of interest here, the concrete ditch does not make me want to "step into the picture".   The composition concept is good, just not a good subject for it.', '2012-05-11 00:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766375, 1014540, 69008, '<td valign="top">The level of detail/ interest in the foreground is out of balance with that of the background in this one. It makes me want to throw a rock across the pond instead of making me want to step into the scene. I would not be sure how to shoot this to make it better though. Maybe shooting with a longer lens and eliminating a lot of the foreground would have worked.</td>', 'The level of detail/ interest in the foreground is out of balance with that of the background in this one. It makes me want to throw a rock across the pond instead of making me want to step into the scene. I would not be sure how to shoot this to make it better though. Maybe shooting with a longer lens and eliminating a lot of the foreground would have worked.', '2012-05-11 01:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766381, 1013710, 69008, '<td valign="top">Cool, but too much mistic, not enough opti.</td>', 'Cool, but too much mistic, not enough opti.', '2012-05-11 01:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766385, 1014592, 69008, '<td valign="top">This one draws me into it, and I like that.</td>', 'This one draws me into it, and I like that.', '2012-05-11 01:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766389, 1014644, 69008, '<td valign="top">This place looks familiar. The stillness gets through to me.</td>', 'This place looks familiar. The stillness gets through to me.', '2012-05-11 01:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766397, 1013933, 69008, '<td valign="top">Home : )   <br/>It looks like the top of the levee around Lake Okechobee. Great leading line, and nice sky. The bird is a plus too.</td>', 'Home : )   It looks like the top of the levee around Lake Okechobee. Great leading line, and nice sky. The bird is a plus too.', '2012-05-11 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766398, 1013882, 69008, '<td valign="top">This one is a little over the top in processing for my taste. It''s pretty to look at though.</td>', 'This one is a little over the top in processing for my taste. It''s pretty to look at though.', '2012-05-11 01:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766401, 1014613, 69008, '<td valign="top">The "on the bridge" point of view leaves the foreground sort of wanting for something interesting to be there.  This is a pretty nice looking place though.</td>', 'The "on the bridge" point of view leaves the foreground sort of wanting for something interesting to be there.  This is a pretty nice looking place though.', '2012-05-11 01:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766402, 1013809, 69008, '<td valign="top">This one should do big with the voters.  I like it too.</td>', 'This one should do big with the voters.  I like it too.', '2012-05-11 01:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766404, 1013884, 69008, '<td valign="top">I''m thinkin'' 4, clickin'' 5.</td>', 'I''m thinkin'' 4, clickin'' 5.', '2012-05-11 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766410, 1014355, 69008, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but contrasty with the processing.</td>', 'Pretty, but contrasty with the processing.', '2012-05-11 01:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766413, 1014603, 69008, '<td valign="top">This would make a nice post card.   I like the Sand Hill Cranes and the gold light in this.</td>', 'This would make a nice post card.   I like the Sand Hill Cranes and the gold light in this.', '2012-05-11 01:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766418, 1014438, 69008, '<td valign="top">Good detail for an image at this resolution.</td>', 'Good detail for an image at this resolution.', '2012-05-11 01:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766433, 1014371, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like that you used very small aperture to get the total image DOF, and that it caused the shutter speed to be low enough to get motion blur in the foreground to suggest a breeze.  Wonderful scene, and POV. The muted tones overall make this one a grabber.</td>', 'I like that you used very small aperture to get the total image DOF, and that it caused the shutter speed to be low enough to get motion blur in the foreground to suggest a breeze.  Wonderful scene, and POV. The muted tones overall make this one a grabber.', '2012-05-11 01:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6766454, 1014619, 123989, '<td valign="top">very unique. I like it a lot.</td>', 'very unique. I like it a lot.', '2012-05-11 01:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
