(6767345, 1014550, 139605, '<td valign="top">a perfect poster!</td>', 'a perfect poster!', '2012-05-12 08:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767388, 1014658, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely, almost looks like a painting or something.</td>', 'Lovely, almost looks like a painting or something.', '2012-05-12 10:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767390, 1014507, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nothing is in focus</td>', 'Nothing is in focus', '2012-05-12 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767436, 1014498, 101668, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful, lovely compo pp and not too much not too little. And yes, I dont mind the ''seascape'' the blue in here contrasts well with the other colours.</td>', 'This is really beautiful, lovely compo pp and not too much not too little. And yes, I dont mind the ''seascape'' the blue in here contrasts well with the other colours.', '2012-05-12 12:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767496, 1014091, 60581, '<td valign="top">definitely one of the best!</td>', 'definitely one of the best!', '2012-05-12 15:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767498, 1014486, 60581, '<td valign="top">interesting style! it feels like bleached!</td>', 'interesting style! it feels like bleached!', '2012-05-12 15:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767499, 1014408, 60581, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best except that when I look at it, the folks down there catches my eyes and they create distraction.</td>', 'This is one of the best except that when I look at it, the folks down there catches my eyes and they create distraction.', '2012-05-12 15:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767569, 1014480, 7327, '<td valign="top">I guess the blocking out of the foreground hills and shoreline was intentional, but for me it didn''t work too well. I really like the depth of the background and the detail in the sky though.</td>', 'I guess the blocking out of the foreground hills and shoreline was intentional, but for me it didn''t work too well. I really like the depth of the background and the detail in the sky though.', '2012-05-12 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767570, 1014262, 7327, '<td valign="top">Really nice, I like the long exposure and the effect on the water. Perhaps a little tighter crop at the top to edit out the bright highlight in the upper left would be my only suggestion. Great shot none the less.</td>', 'Really nice, I like the long exposure and the effect on the water. Perhaps a little tighter crop at the top to edit out the bright highlight in the upper left would be my only suggestion. Great shot none the less.', '2012-05-12 16:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767572, 1013408, 7327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I really like the depth of field and the long exposure effect.</td>', 'Nice shot, I really like the depth of field and the long exposure effect.', '2012-05-12 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767575, 1014354, 7327, '<td valign="top">Very nice,I like the negative space balance with the highlighted face of the mountain and sky.</td>', 'Very nice,I like the negative space balance with the highlighted face of the mountain and sky.', '2012-05-12 16:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767577, 1014580, 7327, '<td valign="top">I guess even if it is in color it wouldn''t make a difference except for the sky. nice shot</td>', 'I guess even if it is in color it wouldn''t make a difference except for the sky. nice shot', '2012-05-12 16:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767580, 1014543, 7327, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of the glass (no pun intended) but the out of focus mountain bothers me a little. Perhaps two exposures shot for sharpness then blended in PS layers. Still it''s a nice image, good composition.</td>', 'I like the sharpness of the glass (no pun intended) but the out of focus mountain bothers me a little. Perhaps two exposures shot for sharpness then blended in PS layers. Still it''s a nice image, good composition.', '2012-05-12 16:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767587, 1013868, 7327, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle shot.</td>', 'Nice wide angle shot.', '2012-05-12 17:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767600, 1014592, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice place, wrong time of day.  Appears to be slanted a little to the left also.</td>', 'Nice place, wrong time of day.  Appears to be slanted a little to the left also.', '2012-05-12 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767601, 1014658, 30049, '<td valign="top">Really?!  Too bad you couldn''t get out and take a real landscape photo; sometimes bad weather is the most dramatic.</td>', 'Really?!  Too bad you couldn''t get out and take a real landscape photo; sometimes bad weather is the most dramatic.', '2012-05-12 17:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767602, 1014619, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is way over-processed IMO.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is way over-processed IMO.', '2012-05-12 17:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767604, 1014259, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice B/W conversion.</td>', 'Very nice B/W conversion.', '2012-05-12 17:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767606, 1014605, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something about this balances quite nicely.  I think it''s the natural division from grass to rocks to background hills and sky.  Well seen and captured.</td>', 'Something about this balances quite nicely.  I think it''s the natural division from grass to rocks to background hills and sky.  Well seen and captured.', '2012-05-12 17:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767607, 1014643, 30049, '<td valign="top">Feels strange.  What happened to the sky and clouds in the upper corners?  Some unusual coloring also (kind of a lomo feel).</td>', 'Feels strange.  What happened to the sky and clouds in the upper corners?  Some unusual coloring also (kind of a lomo feel).', '2012-05-12 17:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767609, 1014596, 30049, '<td valign="top">Color cast is a bit on the "warm" side.  Lovely scene however and the comp is nice.</td>', 'Color cast is a bit on the "warm" side.  Lovely scene however and the comp is nice.', '2012-05-12 17:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767618, 1014592, 119863, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far.  Horizon seems a bit off-level, but there''s great detail and the curve of the branch parallels the curved hills.  A little shadowing and some haze in the sky, but much better than gross HDR levels.</td>', 'My favorite so far.  Horizon seems a bit off-level, but there''s great detail and the curve of the branch parallels the curved hills.  A little shadowing and some haze in the sky, but much better than gross HDR levels.', '2012-05-12 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767619, 1013710, 119863, '<td valign="top">One of the only pictorial photos I actually enjoy.</td>', 'One of the only pictorial photos I actually enjoy.', '2012-05-12 17:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767645, 1013408, 86447, '<td valign="top">Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a photo of waves on rocks.<br/> <br/>To be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon.    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D</td>', 'Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a photo of waves on rocks. To be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon.    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D', '2012-05-12 18:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767646, 1014640, 86447, '<td valign="top">Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a a man at a table.<br/> <br/>To be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon.    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D</td>', 'Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a a man at a table. To be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon.    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D', '2012-05-12 18:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767647, 1013323, 86447, '<td valign="top">Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a photo of the wood.<br/> <br/>To be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon.    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D</td>', 'Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a photo of the wood. To be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon.    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D', '2012-05-12 18:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767651, 1013599, 86447, '<td valign="top">Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a wonderful photo of footsteps to a girl.  (LOVE the leading line!)  <br/> <br/>However, to be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon (and should include the horizon if it''s not blocked by stuff)    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D<br/> <br/>And even though this is DNMC to me... it''s still a 6 to me.  I do love it.</td>', 'Although I love this... it''s beautiful, to me... it''s a wonderful photo of footsteps to a girl.  (LOVE the leading line!)   However, to be a "landscape", at least in my book, the focus of the image needs to be farther out to the horizon (and should include the horizon if it''s not blocked by stuff)    But, I''m just one opinion.  :D And even though this is DNMC to me... it''s still a 6 to me.  I do love it.', '2012-05-12 18:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767652, 1013868, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh golly!  The earth has TILTED!!   I''m falling...   LOL!<br/> <br/>I''m sure you''ve heard that this is wonderful, but really, really needs to be leveled so all of the water doesn''t fall off the Earth.<br/> <br/>I love the colors and the reflections.  6</td>', 'Oh golly!  The earth has TILTED!!   I''m falling...   LOL! I''m sure you''ve heard that this is wonderful, but really, really needs to be leveled so all of the water doesn''t fall off the Earth. I love the colors and the reflections.  6', '2012-05-12 18:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
