(6767715, 1013968, 30982, '<td valign="top">A different sort of landscape.  Nice option!</td>', 'A different sort of landscape.  Nice option!', '2012-05-12 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767716, 1014486, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and ovely.  I like the partially harvested field, and you certainly had a lovely sky!</td>', 'Simple and ovely.  I like the partially harvested field, and you certainly had a lovely sky!', '2012-05-12 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767717, 1014577, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice scorched-earth kind of shot.  Sky is a bit heavy-handed for me, but does suit the subject.</td>', 'A nice scorched-earth kind of shot.  Sky is a bit heavy-handed for me, but does suit the subject.', '2012-05-12 20:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767718, 1014280, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of that moon - I missed it entirely!</td>', 'Nice capture of that moon - I missed it entirely!', '2012-05-12 20:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767719, 1013801, 30982, '<td valign="top">See, now this is what most normal folks get to see - not the sweeping expanses of gorgeous vistas... Nice change of pace with this!</td>', 'See, now this is what most normal folks get to see - not the sweeping expanses of gorgeous vistas... Nice change of pace with this!', '2012-05-12 20:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767720, 1013399, 30982, '<td valign="top">Peaceful!</td>', 'Peaceful!', '2012-05-12 20:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767721, 1013325, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like using the powerlines as a grounding (ha!) force in your photo rather than trying to hide them as happens often with landscapes.</td>', 'I like using the powerlines as a grounding (ha!) force in your photo rather than trying to hide them as happens often with landscapes.', '2012-05-12 20:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767722, 1014549, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like your landscape choice.  I''m not as fond of the selective color, but I''m guessing it is to make a point.</td>', 'I really like your landscape choice.  I''m not as fond of the selective color, but I''m guessing it is to make a point.', '2012-05-12 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767723, 1014491, 30982, '<td valign="top">Serene and restful.</td>', 'Serene and restful.', '2012-05-12 20:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767725, 1014628, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light and color.  Really nice composition, too.</td>', 'Gorgeous light and color.  Really nice composition, too.', '2012-05-12 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767793, 1014405, 30982, '<td valign="top">Such a delightful change of pace.</td>', 'Such a delightful change of pace.', '2012-05-12 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767794, 1014615, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice.  As I mentioned in another shot in this challenge, I LIKE seeing the powerlines included sometimes.  They ARE a part of the landscape!  The stars and a sweet addition, as is the golden light from the homes.</td>', 'Nice.  As I mentioned in another shot in this challenge, I LIKE seeing the powerlines included sometimes.  They ARE a part of the landscape!  The stars and a sweet addition, as is the golden light from the homes.', '2012-05-12 23:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767795, 1014619, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very stylistic - a fairy tale land.  Love the detail in the foreground and how it fades as you continue on.</td>', 'Very stylistic - a fairy tale land.  Love the detail in the foreground and how it fades as you continue on.', '2012-05-12 23:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767796, 1014578, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised he let you get that close!</td>', 'I''m surprised he let you get that close!', '2012-05-12 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767798, 1014644, 30982, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Salton Sea in California.  Gorgeous, delicate sky; love the hard line of the horizon.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Salton Sea in California.  Gorgeous, delicate sky; love the hard line of the horizon.', '2012-05-12 23:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767799, 1014605, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome formation!!</td>', 'Awesome formation!!', '2012-05-12 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767800, 1014001, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice gentle landscape.  Good to see a few here and there that are sweet and simple.</td>', 'Nice gentle landscape.  Good to see a few here and there that are sweet and simple.', '2012-05-12 23:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767801, 1014652, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the gate.  Also like the hints of things beyond - the steps, the structure, a cow in the distance perhaps?  A nice landscape to explore.</td>', 'Love the gate.  Also like the hints of things beyond - the steps, the structure, a cow in the distance perhaps?  A nice landscape to explore.', '2012-05-12 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767802, 1014356, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like this perspective!</td>', 'I really like this perspective!', '2012-05-12 23:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767804, 1014498, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice layers and soft textures in this - quite pleasing.</td>', 'Nice layers and soft textures in this - quite pleasing.', '2012-05-12 23:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767805, 1014382, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has that Florida sunset color/glow to it.  Nice catch of the moon and Venus!</td>', 'Has that Florida sunset color/glow to it.  Nice catch of the moon and Venus!', '2012-05-12 23:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767806, 1014557, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice compilation of "scapes" with land and urban blended.</td>', 'Nice compilation of "scapes" with land and urban blended.', '2012-05-12 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767807, 1014630, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the pale greens emerging.  I think the processing suits this well.</td>', 'I like the pale greens emerging.  I think the processing suits this well.', '2012-05-12 23:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767808, 1014603, 30982, '<td valign="top">The softness suits this - along with the gentle greens and yellows.  Nice touch with the birds!</td>', 'The softness suits this - along with the gentle greens and yellows.  Nice touch with the birds!', '2012-05-12 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767809, 1014210, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent impact.  And gotta love that tree!  What character!</td>', 'Excellent impact.  And gotta love that tree!  What character!', '2012-05-12 23:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767811, 1014645, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice discussion between the lone tree and the radio tower in the far far distance...</td>', 'There''s a nice discussion between the lone tree and the radio tower in the far far distance...', '2012-05-12 23:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767812, 1014599, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an interesting place!  Perhaps a bit overtweaked (although I can say the same about my entry, too.)</td>', 'What an interesting place!  Perhaps a bit overtweaked (although I can say the same about my entry, too.)', '2012-05-12 23:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767813, 1014408, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m fond of straightening the ocean/sky horizon - this looks a wee bit off to me.  I really like the inclusion of the people to give it scale.</td>', 'I''m fond of straightening the ocean/sky horizon - this looks a wee bit off to me.  I really like the inclusion of the people to give it scale.', '2012-05-12 23:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767814, 1014651, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bleak.  And one wonders how trash gets out this far.  Insidious, isn''t it?</td>', 'Bleak.  And one wonders how trash gets out this far.  Insidious, isn''t it?', '2012-05-12 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767815, 1014268, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely landscape, and very well done in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Quite a lovely landscape, and very well done in B&W.', '2012-05-12 23:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767816, 1013591, 30982, '<td valign="top">Classic and well rendered.</td>', 'Classic and well rendered.', '2012-05-12 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767817, 1014056, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice choice of subject but the vignetting at the top is overbearing.</td>', 'A nice choice of subject but the vignetting at the top is overbearing.', '2012-05-12 23:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767818, 1014094, 30982, '<td valign="top">An awesome road for a mountain bike, I''m guessing!  I crave a bit more definition.</td>', 'An awesome road for a mountain bike, I''m guessing!  I crave a bit more definition.', '2012-05-12 23:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767819, 1014368, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice film feel to this.</td>', 'Nice film feel to this.', '2012-05-12 23:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767820, 1014279, 30982, '<td valign="top">Another excellent use of power lines in a landscape.  Nice flare, too!</td>', 'Another excellent use of power lines in a landscape.  Nice flare, too!', '2012-05-12 23:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767821, 1014371, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground motion of the grasses.  Gives it energy.</td>', 'I like the foreground motion of the grasses.  Gives it energy.', '2012-05-12 23:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767826, 1014101, 30982, '<td valign="top">Works very well in B&amp;W.  I especially like the lone figure over on the right.</td>', 'Works very well in B&W.  I especially like the lone figure over on the right.', '2012-05-12 23:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767827, 1013805, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like fields of rape seed.  Lovely yellow!</td>', 'Looks like fields of rape seed.  Lovely yellow!', '2012-05-12 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767828, 1014640, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a novel approach to a landscape.  Works for me (but I''m a sucker for a great B&amp;W candid...)</td>', 'Definitely a novel approach to a landscape.  Works for me (but I''m a sucker for a great B&W candid...)', '2012-05-12 23:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767829, 1014624, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones!</td>', 'Lovely tones!', '2012-05-12 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767832, 1014653, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfectly titled and a wonderful micro-landscape.</td>', 'Perfectly titled and a wonderful micro-landscape.', '2012-05-12 23:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767833, 1014376, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way the birds like to watch the waves.  Nice detail, rich color here.  I also like the 16:9 aspect ratio.</td>', 'I like the way the birds like to watch the waves.  Nice detail, rich color here.  I also like the 16:9 aspect ratio.', '2012-05-12 23:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767835, 1014550, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very artistic rendition!</td>', 'Very artistic rendition!', '2012-05-12 23:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767837, 1014580, 30982, '<td valign="top">So glad you included the four at the top - wonderful sense of scale!</td>', 'So glad you included the four at the top - wonderful sense of scale!', '2012-05-12 23:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767838, 1014355, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kinda reminds me of a Stephen King story - the poor folks in that structure are about to be struck by some sort of horrible evil... I wish them luck!</td>', 'Kinda reminds me of a Stephen King story - the poor folks in that structure are about to be struck by some sort of horrible evil... I wish them luck!', '2012-05-13 00:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767839, 1013795, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nothing spoils a lovely view quite as much as an annoying sign... Great song about that from long ago...</td>', 'Nothing spoils a lovely view quite as much as an annoying sign... Great song about that from long ago...', '2012-05-13 00:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767840, 1014546, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great use of a foreground subject in your landscape!</td>', 'Great use of a foreground subject in your landscape!', '2012-05-13 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767842, 1014176, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sun in frame!</td>', 'Nice use of sun in frame!', '2012-05-13 00:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767918, 1014640, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not the usual landscape but that''s what makes it stand out and be enjoyable.</td>', 'Not the usual landscape but that''s what makes it stand out and be enjoyable.', '2012-05-13 07:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6767931, 1014550, 54446, '<td valign="top">A bit moody, but that fits the dark sky.  This is an effective image.</td>', 'A bit moody, but that fits the dark sky.  This is an effective image.', '2012-05-13 09:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768004, 1014411, 23412, '<td valign="top">This is a bit dark on my monitor, but I like the painted look.  The tan foliage in the center provides a good focal point.  Composition is good to my eye, but I wish the whole thing was just a bit lighter.</td>', 'This is a bit dark on my monitor, but I like the painted look.  The tan foliage in the center provides a good focal point.  Composition is good to my eye, but I wish the whole thing was just a bit lighter.', '2012-05-13 14:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768006, 1013801, 23412, '<td valign="top">I like the blue water, which provides a nice contrast to the dingy white cement and brown scrub brush.  Too bad there wasn''t more water running through to provide a cleaner look to the "river" because that blue is wonderful.</td>', 'I like the blue water, which provides a nice contrast to the dingy white cement and brown scrub brush.  Too bad there wasn''t more water running through to provide a cleaner look to the "river" because that blue is wonderful.', '2012-05-13 14:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768009, 1014462, 23412, '<td valign="top">if this is through a windshield, I applaud your glass cleaning skills.  I wish the horizon was a bit further from the center.  The sky seems more appealing than the asphalt in the foreground, so I might have gone for 2/3 sky and 1/3 highway.</td>', 'if this is through a windshield, I applaud your glass cleaning skills.  I wish the horizon was a bit further from the center.  The sky seems more appealing than the asphalt in the foreground, so I might have gone for 2/3 sky and 1/3 highway.', '2012-05-13 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768010, 1014650, 23412, '<td valign="top">I like this composition.  The colors are bit muted for my taste.  Would like to see bluer sky and water.  I''d be tempted to consider cropping the white building on the left and the point on the right, but I like the width the way you have it.</td>', 'I like this composition.  The colors are bit muted for my taste.  Would like to see bluer sky and water.  I''d be tempted to consider cropping the white building on the left and the point on the right, but I like the width the way you have it.', '2012-05-13 14:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768020, 1014619, 23412, '<td valign="top">This may not score well with voters who just give it a quick look.  I like the effect, but I have only come to that appreciation after several viewings.  The more defined tree in the foreground is enhanced by the brighter stand in the middle of the frame.  It does look mysterious.  :)</td>', 'This may not score well with voters who just give it a quick look.  I like the effect, but I have only come to that appreciation after several viewings.  The more defined tree in the foreground is enhanced by the brighter stand in the middle of the frame.  It does look mysterious.  :)', '2012-05-13 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768022, 1014442, 23412, '<td valign="top">You might have titled this "boot sucking mud".  I like the brown and the blue colors and the way the big puddle almost melts in to the like-colored sky near the horizon.  The model is hard to make out, but she appears to be standing on one leg, possibly because she has lost her boot to the mud on the other side of the pond.  :)</td>', 'You might have titled this "boot sucking mud".  I like the brown and the blue colors and the way the big puddle almost melts in to the like-colored sky near the horizon.  The model is hard to make out, but she appears to be standing on one leg, possibly because she has lost her boot to the mud on the other side of the pond.  :)', '2012-05-13 14:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768024, 1013942, 23412, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. The light coming under the bridge creates some unexpected colors in the water.  That tall building is so tall it is hard to make it work with the rest of the composition.  It would be interesting to see the shot taken with a focus more on that building along with some of the water/bridge in the foreground, but cropping out the building on the left (for example).  The building is leaning in the frame, and I''d like to see that brought to vertical for the photo.</td>', 'Interesting scene. The light coming under the bridge creates some unexpected colors in the water.  That tall building is so tall it is hard to make it work with the rest of the composition.  It would be interesting to see the shot taken with a focus more on that building along with some of the water/bridge in the foreground, but cropping out the building on the left (for example).  The building is leaning in the frame, and I''d like to see that brought to vertical for the photo.', '2012-05-13 14:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768028, 1014008, 23412, '<td valign="top">I like the old fence in the foreground and the grass is interesting.  The lack of color suits the scene.  In my opinion, the show would have been better if taken from closer to ground level since I have the feeling that we''re standing on a balcony looking down on the yard.  Also, a lower shot would help to deal with the street along the back edge, which does not seem to enhance the picture of the yard.</td>', 'I like the old fence in the foreground and the grass is interesting.  The lack of color suits the scene.  In my opinion, the show would have been better if taken from closer to ground level since I have the feeling that we''re standing on a balcony looking down on the yard.  Also, a lower shot would help to deal with the street along the back edge, which does not seem to enhance the picture of the yard.', '2012-05-13 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768066, 1013801, 97559, '<td valign="top">Looks like Florence!</td>', 'Looks like Florence!', '2012-05-13 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768120, 1013805, 23412, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top picks.  I love the big sky and the yellow hues in the fields.  Overall a great composition and wonderful colors.</td>', 'This is one of my top picks.  I love the big sky and the yellow hues in the fields.  Overall a great composition and wonderful colors.', '2012-05-13 20:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768123, 1014359, 23412, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the dark water really makes this picture pop.  The cold look of the snowy mountains in the background and the icy but water in the middle are nicely contrasted with the warm yellow light reflected from the moon.  The moon might be a bit hazy, but it is worth it to get that reflection.  Great pic!</td>', 'The reflection on the dark water really makes this picture pop.  The cold look of the snowy mountains in the background and the icy but water in the middle are nicely contrasted with the warm yellow light reflected from the moon.  The moon might be a bit hazy, but it is worth it to get that reflection.  Great pic!', '2012-05-13 20:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768127, 1014299, 23412, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the water reflects the sky in this one, and the blues are great.  The composition separates sky, land, and water into roughy equal parts, and each is offered in just the right amount.  This is one of my favorites.  It makes we want to visit!</td>', 'I really like the way the water reflects the sky in this one, and the blues are great.  The composition separates sky, land, and water into roughy equal parts, and each is offered in just the right amount.  This is one of my favorites.  It makes we want to visit!', '2012-05-13 20:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768130, 1014603, 23412, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot.  You live in a beautiful place!  This makes me think of Africa with the tall trees and big birds swooping.  The tall trees in the foreground (middle) along with those big birds also give this a bit of a Jurassic Park feel.  That one bird is almost big enough to be a young pterodactyl. :)  I like the way the yellow grass becomes a haze in the trees and eventually almost a dust in the sky.  This is a top pick for me.  Good luck in the ranking.</td>', 'Wow!  Great shot.  You live in a beautiful place!  This makes me think of Africa with the tall trees and big birds swooping.  The tall trees in the foreground (middle) along with those big birds also give this a bit of a Jurassic Park feel.  That one bird is almost big enough to be a young pterodactyl. :)  I like the way the yellow grass becomes a haze in the trees and eventually almost a dust in the sky.  This is a top pick for me.  Good luck in the ranking.', '2012-05-13 20:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768133, 1013591, 23412, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!  It is my favorite.  It doesn''t seem to be a standard reflection photo, but the reflection off the water really is doing a lot to pull everything together.  I like the steely colors that seem so appropriate to the snowy scene.  Great job!</td>', 'This is amazing!  It is my favorite.  It doesn''t seem to be a standard reflection photo, but the reflection off the water really is doing a lot to pull everything together.  I like the steely colors that seem so appropriate to the snowy scene.  Great job!', '2012-05-13 20:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768135, 1014210, 23412, '<td valign="top">The desaturated colors, the sharpness of the foreground crops (corn?), and that dead tree against a foreboding sky really give this a haunted look.  This would be a great movie poster for a horror movie.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'The desaturated colors, the sharpness of the foreground crops (corn?), and that dead tree against a foreboding sky really give this a haunted look.  This would be a great movie poster for a horror movie.  One of my favorites.', '2012-05-13 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768136, 1014176, 23412, '<td valign="top">There is so much to love about this picture.  The composition is great.  You''ve managed to get 2/3 sky, 1/3  treetops, and 1/3 grass making for 4/3 along the horizontal axis!  That makes for an additional 1/3 of a picture as a bonus!  :)  I really like the sun burning through and the shadows for those two wonderful trees.  I hope to see this score very well in the overall rankings.</td>', 'There is so much to love about this picture.  The composition is great.  You''ve managed to get 2/3 sky, 1/3  treetops, and 1/3 grass making for 4/3 along the horizontal axis!  That makes for an additional 1/3 of a picture as a bonus!  :)  I really like the sun burning through and the shadows for those two wonderful trees.  I hope to see this score very well in the overall rankings.', '2012-05-13 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768141, 1014359, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and great reflection.</td>', 'Nice colors and great reflection.', '2012-05-13 21:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768142, 1014657, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice skyline image.</td>', 'Very nice skyline image.', '2012-05-13 21:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768143, 1013306, 23484, '<td valign="top">The colortone is nice.</td>', 'The colortone is nice.', '2012-05-13 21:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768228, 1014645, 23412, '<td valign="top">The lone tree on a flat plain is a solid concept, but the scale of that particular tree is small enough that the various small bushes in the foreground take away from the overall effect.  I really like the gray sky and the position of the horizon relative to the overall frame, but the foreground detracts from the composition in my opinion.</td>', 'The lone tree on a flat plain is a solid concept, but the scale of that particular tree is small enough that the various small bushes in the foreground take away from the overall effect.  I really like the gray sky and the position of the horizon relative to the overall frame, but the foreground detracts from the composition in my opinion.', '2012-05-13 23:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768231, 1014543, 23412, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the attempt to creatively frame the landscape, but this feels like more of a broken window shot.  I can''t see much of the landscape through that hole, and I don''t get the connection between the broken window and the landscape.</td>', 'I appreciate the attempt to creatively frame the landscape, but this feels like more of a broken window shot.  I can''t see much of the landscape through that hole, and I don''t get the connection between the broken window and the landscape.', '2012-05-13 23:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768339, 1014628, 64446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and exposure! Well done! (Salvador, I suppose?)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and exposure! Well done! (Salvador, I suppose?)', '2012-05-14 01:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768348, 1014599, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very exquisite! Great light and I love how the composition takes me through and beyond... Well done, Alessandro!</td>', 'Very exquisite! Great light and I love how the composition takes me through and beyond... Well done, Alessandro!', '2012-05-14 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768768, 1014464, 138630, '<td valign="top">Not my idea of a landscape but a beautiful swan.</td>', 'Not my idea of a landscape but a beautiful swan.', '2012-05-14 11:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768873, 1014587, 142473, '<td valign="top">Very interesting cloud colors...</td>', 'Very interesting cloud colors...', '2012-05-14 13:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768874, 1014407, 142473, '<td valign="top">Really nice!  Looks like a touch of sharpening could have helped though.</td>', 'Really nice!  Looks like a touch of sharpening could have helped though.', '2012-05-14 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768875, 1014466, 142473, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Love the colors.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Love the colors.', '2012-05-14 13:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768876, 1014599, 142473, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light!  I''m really curious where this is.  Only negative is that single light lighting up the walk.  It steals too much of the viewer''s eye away from the city, I think.</td>', 'Wonderful light!  I''m really curious where this is.  Only negative is that single light lighting up the walk.  It steals too much of the viewer''s eye away from the city, I think.', '2012-05-14 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768879, 1014370, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great tones and colors.  The roof kinda ruins it, but also makes you wish you lived there.  I''m a bit torn.</td>', 'Great tones and colors.  The roof kinda ruins it, but also makes you wish you lived there.  I''m a bit torn.', '2012-05-14 13:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768880, 1014367, 142473, '<td valign="top">Could be a great shot if processed right.  Needs a lot of darkening and burning in the mountains.</td>', 'Could be a great shot if processed right.  Needs a lot of darkening and burning in the mountains.', '2012-05-14 13:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768881, 1014063, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great setting!</td>', 'Great setting!', '2012-05-14 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768882, 1014488, 142473, '<td valign="top">Perfect light!  I really like the glider up there.  The vanishing point of the mountains is pretty great too!</td>', 'Perfect light!  I really like the glider up there.  The vanishing point of the mountains is pretty great too!', '2012-05-14 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768884, 1013942, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but taking an image INTO the sun is always difficult.</td>', 'Not bad, but taking an image INTO the sun is always difficult.', '2012-05-14 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768887, 1014550, 142473, '<td valign="top">Really nice processing.  Great darkness, and it seems like you eliminated a good bit of that "hdr glow" that I don''t really like.</td>', 'Really nice processing.  Great darkness, and it seems like you eliminated a good bit of that "hdr glow" that I don''t really like.', '2012-05-14 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768888, 1014577, 142473, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, especially for the ansel adams challenge.  Needs some sharpening though, as it seems a hair blurry.</td>', 'Wonderful, especially for the ansel adams challenge.  Needs some sharpening though, as it seems a hair blurry.', '2012-05-14 13:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768894, 1014050, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lovin'' the processing here.</td>', 'Lovin'' the processing here.', '2012-05-14 14:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768895, 1014210, 118154, '<td valign="top">YEP 8</td>', 'YEP 8', '2012-05-14 14:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6768959, 1013805, 67258, '<td valign="top">Rape fields do look wonderful in this sort of light, and you have chosen a lovely composition with the gently rolling and folding land.</td>', 'Rape fields do look wonderful in this sort of light, and you have chosen a lovely composition with the gently rolling and folding land.', '2012-05-14 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769014, 1014644, 138253, '<td valign="top">They said "LAND" scape, not ''sea'' scape. DNMC!!!!<br/> <br/>;-)<br/>joking, this is a nice pic, only real detracting point in my opinion is the depth between left/right side of log for the water. As such, there is a lot of clutter just beneath the surface on the right that is not as noticable on the left given the extension of the beach.<br/>Still a 6/10 though, very serene!</td>', 'They said "LAND" scape, not ''sea'' scape. DNMC!!!! ;-)joking, this is a nice pic, only real detracting point in my opinion is the depth between left/right side of log for the water. As such, there is a lot of clutter just beneath the surface on the right that is not as noticable on the left given the extension of the beach.Still a 6/10 though, very serene!', '2012-05-14 16:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769016, 1014657, 138253, '<td valign="top">Check white balance? Feels too yellow for a city skyline shot.</td>', 'Check white balance? Feels too yellow for a city skyline shot.', '2012-05-14 16:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769018, 1014464, 138253, '<td valign="top">Fail to see how this guy is landscape.<br/>if you''re referring to his features as an abstract definition, you''ll understand (i''m sure) how my score is an abstract definition as well. ;)</td>', 'Fail to see how this guy is landscape.if you''re referring to his features as an abstract definition, you''ll understand (i''m sure) how my score is an abstract definition as well. ;)', '2012-05-14 16:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769019, 1013933, 138253, '<td valign="top">does this road to nowhere lead to Ozzy, or is that a different road to nowhere???</td>', 'does this road to nowhere lead to Ozzy, or is that a different road to nowhere???', '2012-05-14 16:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769020, 1013399, 138253, '<td valign="top">looks like "the road to nowhere" from a few entries back. <br/>so main street leads nowhere eh? good to know</td>', 'looks like "the road to nowhere" from a few entries back. so main street leads nowhere eh? good to know', '2012-05-14 16:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769031, 1013526, 142345, '<td valign="top">The tree is a bit distracting and seems out of place.</td>', 'The tree is a bit distracting and seems out of place.', '2012-05-14 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769044, 1013884, 115644, '<td valign="top">I really like the scene, but the tonemapping is a bit much. Blue skies and white clouds don''t work with HDR and tonemapping, and I would blend them with the original sky from the  -1 exposure or the normal exposure. Also notice the white around the field gets dirtied up by tonemapping, so you can blend that in with one of the exposures as well.</td>', 'I really like the scene, but the tonemapping is a bit much. Blue skies and white clouds don''t work with HDR and tonemapping, and I would blend them with the original sky from the  -1 exposure or the normal exposure. Also notice the white around the field gets dirtied up by tonemapping, so you can blend that in with one of the exposures as well.', '2012-05-14 17:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769045, 1014377, 115644, '<td valign="top">really interested in the processing of this one. 73%in through the voting and this is my fav so far.</td>', 'really interested in the processing of this one. 73%in through the voting and this is my fav so far.', '2012-05-14 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769047, 1014543, 115644, '<td valign="top">please tell me you didn''t bust out the windo just for this challenge. really creative idea that you could do a lot of things with. might have to steal it :P</td>', 'please tell me you didn''t bust out the windo just for this challenge. really creative idea that you could do a lot of things with. might have to steal it :P', '2012-05-14 17:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769049, 1013591, 115644, '<td valign="top">yea... where was the ansel adams challenge when you took this one, right? AWESOME!</td>', 'yea... where was the ansel adams challenge when you took this one, right? AWESOME!', '2012-05-14 17:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769050, 1014370, 115644, '<td valign="top">looks like it''s time to clean your sensor or lens, but the scene is really nice.</td>', 'looks like it''s time to clean your sensor or lens, but the scene is really nice.', '2012-05-14 17:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769095, 1014279, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely exposure with the sun flare. A little over sharp in the grass for me. Knock that down to more realistic levels, and I would give this another point.</td>', 'Lovely exposure with the sun flare. A little over sharp in the grass for me. Knock that down to more realistic levels, and I would give this another point.', '2012-05-14 19:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769096, 1014596, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful area. It''s really too bad that electric wire is running through it.</td>', 'Beautiful area. It''s really too bad that electric wire is running through it.', '2012-05-14 19:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769097, 1014438, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done B&amp;W. This type of contrast is what I aspire to.</td>', 'Very well done B&W. This type of contrast is what I aspire to.', '2012-05-14 19:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769098, 1014643, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful area, and I like the closed in composition. But the color gradients seem really off to me.</td>', 'Beautiful area, and I like the closed in composition. But the color gradients seem really off to me.', '2012-05-14 19:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769099, 1014377, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the foreground elements to give this scale.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the foreground elements to give this scale.', '2012-05-14 19:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769100, 1014489, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job layering your photo. I''m not too keen on the vignette, it takes away from the overall scene in my opinion.</td>', 'Great job layering your photo. I''m not too keen on the vignette, it takes away from the overall scene in my opinion.', '2012-05-14 19:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769102, 1013881, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice lines in the field. Image seems a bit on the dark side to me.</td>', 'Nice lines in the field. Image seems a bit on the dark side to me.', '2012-05-14 19:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769126, 1014370, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of sun. I accidently had corner sun get in a photo recently, and the result is magical.</td>', 'Lovely use of sun. I accidently had corner sun get in a photo recently, and the result is magical.', '2012-05-14 19:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769128, 1014550, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous use of reflections in what I have to imagine was a date filled with moving water.</td>', 'Gorgeous use of reflections in what I have to imagine was a date filled with moving water.', '2012-05-14 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769130, 1014299, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great serenity to this scene.</td>', 'Great serenity to this scene.', '2012-05-14 19:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769131, 1014210, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really liking the perspective you chose. Adds a bit of claustrophobia.</td>', 'Really liking the perspective you chose. Adds a bit of claustrophobia.', '2012-05-14 19:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769132, 1014627, 114225, '<td valign="top">Liking the silhouettes. Although this seems like a bit more sharpness could do it good. Maybe really bring down the aperture to get a large depth of field.</td>', 'Liking the silhouettes. Although this seems like a bit more sharpness could do it good. Maybe really bring down the aperture to get a large depth of field.', '2012-05-14 19:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769134, 1014408, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing colors in the the sky, rocks, and water. Very nice capture.</td>', 'Wow, amazing colors in the the sky, rocks, and water. Very nice capture.', '2012-05-14 19:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769135, 1013408, 114225, '<td valign="top">A standard that is always beautiful.</td>', 'A standard that is always beautiful.', '2012-05-14 19:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769136, 1014587, 114225, '<td valign="top">That is an ominous sight when you are that high up (especially if you don''t have nearby shelter).</td>', 'That is an ominous sight when you are that high up (especially if you don''t have nearby shelter).', '2012-05-14 19:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769137, 1014652, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this image. It has a certain quaintness to it.</td>', 'I like this image. It has a certain quaintness to it.', '2012-05-14 19:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769138, 1014559, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cool sight! Great way to balance out the scene.</td>', 'What a cool sight! Great way to balance out the scene.', '2012-05-14 19:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769139, 1014540, 114225, '<td valign="top">With some beautiful golden light, this could be a really special scene. It''s too bad the clouds are giving it a flatness that cannot be overcome easily.</td>', 'With some beautiful golden light, this could be a really special scene. It''s too bad the clouds are giving it a flatness that cannot be overcome easily.', '2012-05-14 19:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769140, 1014359, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done. This creates a really nice sense of aloneness.</td>', 'Very well done. This creates a really nice sense of aloneness.', '2012-05-14 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769141, 1014613, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the balance of this composition. Not a huge fan of the dominant color cast.</td>', 'I like the balance of this composition. Not a huge fan of the dominant color cast.', '2012-05-14 19:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769143, 1014411, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen setting. For a dark image, it still has a lot of life to it.</td>', 'Nicely seen setting. For a dark image, it still has a lot of life to it.', '2012-05-14 19:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769144, 1013795, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the color separation and the various lines and curves featured in this image.</td>', 'I like the color separation and the various lines and curves featured in this image.', '2012-05-14 19:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769148, 1014612, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job using the natural framing you have available.</td>', 'Great job using the natural framing you have available.', '2012-05-14 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769149, 1014354, 114225, '<td valign="top">The moon in this photo reminds me of a shot I missed because I was on an airplane taking off. I still yearn over that shot. I''m glad you captured something similar.</td>', 'The moon in this photo reminds me of a shot I missed because I was on an airplane taking off. I still yearn over that shot. I''m glad you captured something similar.', '2012-05-14 19:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769151, 1013805, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this. You did a great job showing off the natural rural curves.</td>', 'I really enjoy this. You did a great job showing off the natural rural curves.', '2012-05-14 19:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6769330, 1013805, 25190, '<td valign="top">Wonderful blend of colors and great depth of field the clouds give it that extra POP Well done ...</td>', 'Wonderful blend of colors and great depth of field the clouds give it that extra POP Well done ...', '2012-05-15 02:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
