(6770488, 1014094, 36133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rathomas:</b></div><hr/><i> Great attention to position / composition at the time of the shot.  Were you riding as a passenger in a moving car?  I''m guessing so, from the slight motion blur.  Really like this.  I grew up ski racing and it is a window into what you see going down a course. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks! Actually was standing by the roadside. It was a bit hazy and I zoomed the telephoto to compress the curves in the road. This also magnified the haze and I think added the overall softness of the image. I liked the effect, so I thought it might be worth entering.</td>', 'Originally posted by rathomas: Great attention to position / composition at the time of the shot.  Were you riding as a passenger in a moving car?  I''m guessing so, from the slight motion blur.  Really like this.  I grew up ski racing and it is a window into what you see going down a course.  Thanks! Actually was standing by the roadside. It was a bit hazy and I zoomed the telephoto to compress the curves in the road. This also magnified the haze and I think added the overall softness of the image. I liked the effect, so I thought it might be worth entering.', '2012-05-16 08:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
