(6771288, 1014367, 136392, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments! It is SO  helpful! The interesting thing about this picture is that I took 20 pictures at this location and all of your suggestions were in other pictures and I picked this one as the one I liked the best. Photography is SO subjective but I am still grateful for the feedback...it makes me want to work harder :-D <br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments! It is SO  helpful! The interesting thing about this picture is that I took 20 pictures at this location and all of your suggestions were in other pictures and I picked this one as the one I liked the best. Photography is SO subjective but I am still grateful for the feedback...it makes me want to work harder :-D ', '2012-05-17 01:29:40.000000', NULL, 0),
