(6771428, 1014640, 12611, '<td valign="top">Compelling is a good way to describe it. Congrats on the PH Blue- well deserved. I really don''t have any intelligent "art type" critiques of any merit, so I will simply say, i like the patterns of the building in the right background, the pleasing foreground arch, the intrigue of all the empty chairs, and the row of trees leading to the distant "s."</td>', 'Compelling is a good way to describe it. Congrats on the PH Blue- well deserved. I really don''t have any intelligent "art type" critiques of any merit, so I will simply say, i like the patterns of the building in the right background, the pleasing foreground arch, the intrigue of all the empty chairs, and the row of trees leading to the distant "s."', '2012-05-17 09:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
